msgid "Return products"
msgstr "退回產品"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:149
msgid ""
"Returns are completed through *reverse transfers*, which generate new "
"warehouse operations for the returning products. Click the "
":guilabel:`Return` button at the top of a ticket to open the "
":guilabel:`Return` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"退貨透過 *逆向調撥* 完成，系統會為退回的產品產生新的倉庫作業。點擊支援單頂部"
"的 :guilabel:`退貨` 按鈕，即可開啟 :guilabel:`退貨` 彈出式視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:153
msgid "View of a Helpdesk ticket with the return button highlighted."
msgstr "顯示技術支援工單並反白標示退貨按鈕的畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:157
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Return` button **only** appears on a ticket if the customer "
"has a recorded delivery in the database."
msgstr ""
"只有在客戶於資料庫中有送貨記錄時，支援請求上**才**會顯示 :guilabel:`退貨` 按"
"鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:160
msgid ""
"Select a :guilabel:`Sales Order` or :guilabel:`Delivery to Return` to "
"identify the products that need to be returned."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:163
msgid ""
"By default, the quantity matches the validated quantity from the delivery "
"order. Update the :guilabel:`Quantity` field, if necessary. To remove a "
"line, click the :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(trash)` icon."
msgstr ""
"系統預設的數量與交貨單中已驗證的數量相符。如有需要，請更新 :guilabel:`數量` "
"欄位。若要移除明細行，請點擊 :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`（垃圾桶）` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:167
msgid ""
"Select a :guilabel:`Return Location` where the items should be directed "
"after the return is completed."
msgstr "選擇一個 :guilabel:`退貨位置`，以便在完成退貨後將貨品轉送至該處。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:170
msgid "View of a reverse transfer creation page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:173
msgid ""
"To confirm the return, click :guilabel:`Return`. This generates a new "
"warehouse operation for the incoming returned products."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:176
msgid ""
"To exchange the received item with a new one, click :guilabel:`Return for "
"Exchange`. Doing so generates a warehouse operation in Odoo to deliver the "
"replacement product."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:179
msgid ""
"Use the breadcrumbs to return to the helpdesk ticket. A new "
":guilabel:`Return` smart button can now be accessed at the top of the "
"ticket."
msgstr ""
"使用導覽路徑返回服務台工單。現在可在工單頂部使用新的 :guilabel:`退貨` 智能按"
"鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:182
msgid "View of the return smart button on a helpdesk ticket."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:186
msgid ":doc:`../../../sales/sales/products_prices/returns`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../sales/sales/products_prices/returns`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:191
msgid "Send products for repair from a ticket"
msgstr "從支援單寄送產品進行維修"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:193
msgid ""
"If the ticket is related to an issue with a faulty or broken product, a "
"*repair order* can be created from the **Helpdesk** ticket, and managed "
"through the **Repairs** application."
msgstr ""
"如果支援單涉及產品故障或損壞的問題，可直接從 **服務台** 支援單建立 *維修單*，"
"並透過 **維修** 應用程式進行管理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:196
msgid ""
"To create a new repair order, open a :menuselection:`Helpdesk` ticket and "
"click on the :guilabel:`Repair` button in the top-left corner. This opens a "
":guilabel:`Repair Reference` form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:199
msgid "View of a repair reference page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:204
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customer`: this field carries over from the ticket, though a new "
"contact can been selected from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:206
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product to Repair`: if a product was specified in the "
":guilabel:`Product` field on the ticket, it is added to this field "
"automatically. If not, click into the field to select a product from the "
"drop-down menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:209
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Lot/Serial`: this field is **only** visible if the products being"
" repaired are tracked, via lot or serial numbers."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`批次/序號`：此欄位**僅**在維修中的產品設有批次或序號追蹤時才會顯示"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:211
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Return`: return order from which the product to be repaired comes"
" from."
msgstr ":guilabel:`退貨`：需維修產品所屬的退貨單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:212
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Under Warranty`: if this box is checked, the sale price for all "
"products from the repair order are set to zero."
msgstr ":guilabel:`保養期內`：如勾選此方塊，維修訂單上所有產品的售價將設為零。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:214
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Scheduled Date`: this field defaults to the current date. To "
"select a new date, click into the field and select a date using the drop-"
"down calendar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:216
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Responsible`: assign a user from the drop-down menu to manage the"
" repair."
msgstr ":guilabel:`負責人`：從下拉式選單中指派一位用戶來管理該維修作業。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:217
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags`: click into this field to assign an existing tag or create "
"a new one. Multiple tags can be assigned."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:220
msgid ""
"If parts are required for the repair, they can be added in the "
":guilabel:`Parts` tab. Additional information for the internal repair team "
"can be added to the :guilabel:`Repair Notes` tab."
msgstr ""
"如維修需要使用零件，可在 :guilabel:`零件` 分頁中添加。供內部維修團隊參考的其"
"他資訊，則可添加至 :guilabel:`維修備註` 分頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:223
msgid ""
"Once the form is complete, click :guilabel:`Confirm Repair`. To create, "
"edit, and send a quote for this repair, click :guilabel:`Create Quotation`."
msgstr ""
"填妥表單後，點擊 :guilabel:`確認維修`。若要為此維修建立、編輯及發送報價單，請"
"點擊 :guilabel:`建立報價單`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:226
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Repairs` smart button is then added to the ticket, linking to "
"the repair order."
msgstr "隨後，支援請求上會新增一個:guilabel:`維修`智能按鈕，連結至該維修訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:228
msgid "View of smart buttons focusing on repair button."
msgstr "聚焦於維修按鈕的智能按鈕檢視畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:232
msgid ""
"Once a user creates a repair order from a **Helpdesk** ticket, they can "
"access it through the ticket's :guilabel:`Repair` smart button, or from a "
"link in the chatter, even if they do not have access rights to the "
"**Repair** application."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:239
msgid "Plan field service interventions from a ticket"
msgstr "從工單規劃現場服務"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:241
msgid ""
"On-site interventions can be planned from a ticket and managed through the "
"Planning app. Customers with :doc:`portal access "
"<../../../general/users/user_portals>` can track the progress of "
"interventions the same way they would track a **Helpdesk** ticket."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:245
msgid ""
"To enable this feature, go to :menuselection:`Helpdesk --> Configuration -->"
" Helpdesk Teams`, select the relevant team, scroll to the :guilabel:`After-"
"Sales` section, and enable :guilabel:`Field Service`."
msgstr ""
"要啟用此功能，請前往 :menuselection:`支援服務 --> 設定 --> 支援團隊`，選擇相"
"關團隊，向下捲動至 :guilabel:`售後服務` 部分，然後啟用 :guilabel:`現場服務`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:249
msgid ""
"To plan an intervention from a helpdesk ticket, click :guilabel:`Plan "
"Intervention`, then :ref:`create a shift <planning/create-shift>`."
msgstr ""
"如要從支援工單計劃外勤服務，請點擊 :guilabel:`計劃外勤服務`，然後 :ref:`建立"
"班次 <planning/create-shift>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:252
msgid ""
"Once the intervention has been planned, a :guilabel:`Scheduled` smart button"
" displaying the intervention's date and time is added to the ticket. Click "
"the button to open the schedule."
msgstr ""
"安排好現場支援後，工單上便會新增一個顯示支援日期及時間的:guilabel:`已排程`智"
"能按鈕。按一下該按鈕即可開啟時間表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/after_sales.rst:256
msgid ":doc:`/applications/services/planning/field_service`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/services/planning/field_service`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:3
msgid "Close tickets"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:5
msgid ""
"After work has been completed on a ticket in the **Helpdesk** app, there are"
" several ways it can be closed. Manually closing solved tickets keeps the "
"pipeline up to date, while automatically closing inactive tickets prevents "
"unnecessary blocking issues. Allowing customers to close their own tickets "
"minimizes confusion around whether an issue is considered solved or not. "
"This results in increased operational capacity for support teams, and higher"
" customer satisfaction."
msgstr ""
"在 **服務台** 應用程式中完成工單的處理工作後，有多種方法可結束工單。手動結束"
"已解決的工單可讓處理流程保持最新狀態，而自動結束非活躍工單則可避免不必要的阻"
"礙問題。允許客戶自行結束工單，可減少對問題是否已獲解決的混淆，從而提升支援團"
"隊的營運效率及客戶滿意度。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:12
msgid "Manually close solved tickets"
msgstr "手動關閉已解決的支援單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:14
msgid ""
"As work on a ticket progresses, it is moved along to the next stage in the "
"pipeline. When the issue is solved, the ticket is moved to a *folded* stage."
" This marks the ticket as *closed*."
msgstr ""
"隨著工單的處理進度推進，工單會移至流程中的下一個階段。問題解決後，工單會移至 "
"*已摺疊* 階段，這會將工單標記為 *已關閉*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:17
msgid ""
"To fold a stage, navigate to the :menuselection:`Helpdesk` dashboard and "
"click on a team to open the pipeline. Hover over a stage's heading, and then"
" click the :icon:`fa-gear` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon that appears in the top-"
"right corner of that stage's Kanban column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:21
msgid ""
"View of stage on Helpdesk pipeline with emphasis on gear icon and edit stage"
" option."
msgstr "支援服務管道中階段的檢視畫面，重點顯示齒輪圖示及編輯階段選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:25
msgid ""
"Clicking the gear icon also displays the option to :guilabel:`Fold` the "
"stage. This setting folds the stage *temporarily* to simplify the Kanban "
"view. This does **not** close the tickets in this stage. It also does not "
"permanently fold the stage. If a stage needs to be folded so the tickets can"
" be marked as closed, continue following the steps below."
msgstr ""
"點擊齒輪圖示亦會顯示 :guilabel:`摺疊` 該階段的選項。此設定會 *暫時* 摺疊階段"
"以簡化看板檢視。這 **不會** 關閉此階段中的工單，亦不會永久摺疊該階段。如果需"
"要摺疊階段以將工單標記為已關閉，請繼續按照以下步驟操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:30
msgid ""
"From the menu that appears, select :guilabel:`Edit`. This opens the stage's "
"settings. Tick the checkbox labeled :guilabel:`Folded in Kanban`, and then "
":guilabel:`Save & Close` to confirm the changes. Now, tickets are *closed* "
"once they reach this folded stage."
msgstr ""
"從出現的選單中，選擇:guilabel:`編輯`。這會開啟階段設定。勾選標記"
"為:guilabel:`在看板中摺疊`的核取方塊，然後按:guilabel:`儲存並關閉`以確認變更"
"。現在，支援請求一旦到達此已摺疊階段，即會*關閉*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:34
msgid "Stage settings page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:38
msgid "Automatically close inactive tickets"
msgstr "自動關閉非活躍的支援請求"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:40
msgid ""
"Tickets that are inactive for a set period of time can be automatically "
"closed. At that point, they are moved to a folded stage."
msgstr ""
"在設定的一段時間內沒有活動的支援請求可自動關閉。屆時，該等請求會被移至已摺疊"
"的階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:43
msgid ""
"Go to the team's settings page by going to :menuselection:`Helpdesk --> "
"Configuration --> Helpdesk Teams`. Under the :guilabel:`Self-Service` "
"section, enable :guilabel:`Automatic Closing`."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`服務台 --> 設定 --> 服務台團隊` 以開啟團隊設定頁面。在 "
":guilabel:`自助服務` 部分下，啟用 :guilabel:`自動關閉`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:46
msgid ""
"If only one of the team's stages is folded in the Kanban view, it is the "
"default selection in the :guilabel:`Move to Stage` field. If the team has "
"more than one folded stage, the stage that occurs first in the pipeline is "
"the default for this field. If no stage is folded, the default selection is "
"the last stage in the pipeline."
msgstr ""
"如果團隊在看板檢視中只有一個已摺疊的階段，該階段會成為 :guilabel:`移至階段` "
"欄位的預設選項。如果團隊有多個已摺疊的階段，則流程中排在最前的階段會成為此欄"
"位的預設值。如果沒有任何階段被摺疊，預設選項會是流程中的最後一個階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:51
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`After days of inactivity` field defaults to `7`, but can be "
"adjusted if necessary."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:54
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`After days of inactivity` field does **not** take the working"
" calendar into account when tracking the amount of time a ticket has been "
"inactive."
msgstr ""
"追蹤支援單處於非活動狀態的時間長度時，:guilabel:`無活動天數後` 欄位 **不會** "
"將工作日曆納入考慮。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:57
msgid ""
"If only certain stages should be used to track days of inactivity, they can "
"be added to the :guilabel:`In Stages` field."
msgstr ""
"如只需使用特定階段來追蹤非活躍天數，可將這些階段加入 :guilabel:`於階段` 欄位"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:61
msgid "A team's pipeline is created with the following stages:"
msgstr "團隊的工作流程在建立時會包含以下階段："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:63
msgid "`New`"
msgstr "`新建`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:64
msgid "`In Progress`"
msgstr "`進行中`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:65
msgid "`Customer Feedback`"
msgstr "`客戶意見回饋`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:66
msgid "`Closed`"
msgstr "`已關閉`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:68
msgid ""
"Tickets can linger in the :guilabel:`Customer Feedback stage`, because once "
"an issue is solved, customers may not respond immediately. At that point, "
"the tickets can be closed automatically. However, tickets in the "
":guilabel:`New` and :guilabel:`In Progress` stages may remain inactive due "
"to assignment or workload issues. Closing these tickets automatically would "
"result in issues going unsolved."
msgstr ""
"問題解決後，客戶未必會立即回覆，因此服務單可能會一直停留在 :guilabel:`客戶意"
"見回饋階段`。此時，系統可自動關閉這些服務單。不過，位於 :guilabel:`新增` 及 "
":guilabel:`進行中` 階段的服務單，可能會因分派或工作量問題而暫時未有更新。若自"
"動關閉這些服務單，便會導致問題無法解決。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:74
msgid ""
"Therefore, the :guilabel:`Automatic Closing` settings would be configured as"
" below\\:\\"
msgstr "因此，:guilabel:`自動關閉` 設定將會按以下方式配置\\:\\"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:76
msgid ":guilabel:`Automatic Closing`: *checked*"
msgstr ":guilabel:`自動關閉`：*已勾選*"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:77
msgid ":guilabel:`Move to Stage`: `Solved`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`移至階段`：`已解決`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:78
msgid ":guilabel:`After` `7` :guilabel:`days of inactivity`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:79
msgid ":guilabel:`In Stages`: `Customer Feedback`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`所在階段`：`客戶意見回饋`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:81
msgid "Example of Automatic Closing settings."
msgstr "自動關閉設定範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:85
msgid "Allow customers to close their own tickets"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:87
msgid ""
"Enabling the :guilabel:`Closure by Customers` setting allows customers to "
"close their own tickets when they determine that their issue has been "
"resolved."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:90
msgid ""
"Start by navigating to :menuselection:`Helpdesk --> Configuration --> "
"Helpdesk Teams` and select a team. On the team's settings page, scroll to "
"the :guilabel:`Self-Service` section and tick the checkbox for "
":guilabel:`Closure by Customers`."
msgstr ""
"首先前往 :menuselection:`服務台 --> 配置 --> 服務台團隊` 並選擇一個團隊。在該"
"團隊的設定頁面中，捲動至 :guilabel:`自助服務` 部分，然後勾選 :guilabel:`由客"
"戶關閉` 核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:94
msgid "Customer closing setting in Odoo Helpdesk."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:97
msgid ""
"After the ticket closing settings are enabled, a :guilabel:`Close Ticket` "
"button is available for customers when they view their ticket through the "
"customer portal."
msgstr ""
"啟用工單關閉設定後，客戶透過客戶門戶查看其工單時，便會看到 :guilabel:`關閉工"
"單` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:100
msgid "Customer view of ticket closing in Odoo Helpdesk."
msgstr "客戶在 Odoo 支援服務中關閉工單的畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:104
msgid ""
"Customers are able to view their tickets by clicking the :guilabel:`View the"
" ticket` link they receive by email. The link is included in the "
":guilabel:`Request Acknowledgment` template, which is added to the first "
"stage of a team by default. This link does not require a customer to have "
"access to the portal to view or respond to their ticket."
msgstr ""
"客戶可透過點擊電郵中收到的 :guilabel:`檢視支援單` 連結來查看其支援單。此連結"
"包含在 :guilabel:`請求確認` 範本中，該範本預設會新增至團隊的第一個階段。客戶"
"無需擁有門戶網站的存取權限，即可使用此連結檢視或回覆其支援單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets.rst:109
msgid ""
"Customers with access to the :doc:`portal "
"<../../../general/users/user_portals>` are able to view their tickets under "
":menuselection:`My Account --> Tickets`."
msgstr ""
"擁有 :doc:`門戶網站 <../../../general/users/user_portals>` 存取權限的客戶，可"
"在 :menuselection:`我的帳戶 --> 支援請求` 下查看其支援請求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:3
msgid "Track and bill time"
msgstr "追蹤工時並計費"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo **Helpdesk** provides teams with the ability to track the amount of "
"hours spent working on a ticket, and to bill a customer for that time. "
"Through integrations with the **Sales**, **Timesheets**, **Project** and "
"**Accounting** applications, customers can be charged once the work is "
"completed, or before it has even begun."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:13
msgid ""
"Since the *Track & Bill Time* features require integration with other "
"applications, enabling them may result in the installation of additional "
"modules or applications."
msgstr ""
"由於 *追蹤及計費時間* 功能需要與其他應用程式整合，因此啟用這些功能可能會同時"
"安裝額外的模組或應用程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:16
msgid ""
"Installing a new application on a *One-App-Free* database triggers a 15-day "
"trial. At the end of the trial, if a paid subscription has not been added to"
" the database, it will no longer be active or accessible."
msgstr ""
"在 *單一應用程式免費* 資料庫上安裝新應用程式會觸發 15 天試用期。試用期結束時"
"，若資料庫尚未加入付費訂閱，該資料庫將不再有效或無法存取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:21
msgid "Configure track and bill time features"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:23
msgid ""
"Before a customer can be invoiced for support services, the *Track & Bill "
"Time* features **must** be enabled on each **Helpdesk** team individually."
msgstr ""
"在就支援服務向客戶開立發票前，**必須** 先分別在每個 **支援服務** 團隊中啟用 "
"*追蹤及計費時間* 功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:27
msgid "Enable track and bill time on a helpdesk team"
msgstr "在支援團隊啟用工時追蹤及計費"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:29
msgid ""
"To view and enable the *Track & Bill Time* features on a **Helpdesk** team, "
"first navigate to :menuselection:`Helpdesk app --> Configuration --> "
"Helpdesk Teams`. Then, select a team from the list, or create a :doc:`new "
"one <../../helpdesk>`. This reveals a team's settings page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:33
msgid ""
"On the team's settings page, scroll to the :guilabel:`Track & Bill Time` "
"section. Check the boxes labeled :guilabel:`Timesheets` and :guilabel:`Time "
"Billing`."
msgstr ""
"在團隊的設定頁面中，向下捲動至 :guilabel:`追蹤及計費時間` 部分，然後勾選 "
":guilabel:`工時表` 及 :guilabel:`時間計費` 核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:36
msgid ""
"After the :guilabel:`Timesheets` box is checked, a new field appears, "
"labeled :guilabel:`Project`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:39
msgid ""
"If this is the first time this feature has been enabled on this database, "
"the page may need to be manually saved and refreshed before the "
":guilabel:`Project` field appears."
msgstr ""
"如果這是首次在此資料庫啟用此功能，你可能需要手動儲存並重新整理頁面"
"，:guilabel:`項目` 欄位才會顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:42
msgid ""
"The project selected in this field represents where all the timesheets for "
"this team's tickets are recorded. Click into the :guilabel:`Project` drop-"
"down menu to select a project."
msgstr ""
"此欄位中所選的專案，代表此團隊所有支援單的工時表記錄位置。點按:guilabel:`專"
"案`下拉式選單以選擇專案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:45
msgid ""
"To create a new project where the timesheets are recorded, click into the "
":guilabel:`Project` drop-down menu, type a name for the project, and then "
"click :guilabel:`Create` from the drop-down menu beneath."
msgstr ""
"如要建立用於記錄工時表的新項目，請點選:guilabel:`項目`下拉選單，輸入項目名稱"
"，然後在下方下拉選單中按:guilabel:`建立`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:49
msgid ""
"View of a helpdesk team settings page emphasizing the track and bill time "
"settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:55
msgid "Configure service products"
msgstr "配置服務產品"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:57
msgid ""
"When the :guilabel:`Time Billing` feature is enabled, a new product is "
"created in the **Sales** app called *Service on Timesheets*. This product "
"can be found under :menuselection:`Sales app--> Products --> Products`. "
"Then, search for `Service on Timesheets` in the search bar. This is the "
"product that is used when invoicing for *post-paid support services* "
"**after** they have been completed."
msgstr ""
"啟用 :guilabel:`時間計費` 功能後，**銷售** 應用程式會建立一個名為 *按工時表服"
"務* 的新產品。此產品可在 :menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 產品 --> 產品` 找到"
"。然後，在搜尋列中搜尋 `按工時表服務` 。此產品用於在 *後付支援服務* 完成 **之"
"後** 開立發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:63
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Service on Timesheets` from the product page. This reveals"
" the product detail form. The product is configured with the "
":guilabel:`Product Type` set to :guilabel:`Service` and the "
":guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` set to :guilabel:`Based on Timesheets`. Make "
"any necessary changes to the product record, such as the :guilabel:`Cost` or"
" :guilabel:`Sales Price`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:68
msgid ""
"View of a service product with the invoicing policy set to 'Based on "
"timesheets'."
msgstr "服務產品的檢視，其發票政策設為「按工時表」。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:71
msgid ""
"In order to invoice for support services **before** the work has been "
"completed (also known as *prepaid support services*), a separate product "
"with a different invoicing policy must be created."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:74
msgid ""
"To create a new service product, go to :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Products --> Products`, and click :guilabel:`New`. This reveals a blank "
"product detail form."
msgstr ""
"要建立新服務產品，請前往:menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 產品 --> 產品`，然後"
"按一下:guilabel:`新增`。系統會顯示空白的產品詳情表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:77
msgid ""
"On the new product form, add a :guilabel:`Product Name`, and set the "
":guilabel:`Product Type` to :guilabel:`Service`. Then, set the "
":guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` to :guilabel:`Prepaid/Fixed Price`. This means "
"an invoice can be generated and payment can be received for this product "
"before any timesheets entries have been recorded for these services."
msgstr ""
"在新產品表單上，填寫:guilabel:`產品名稱`，並將:guilabel:`產品類型`設"
"為:guilabel:`服務`。然後，將:guilabel:`開立發票政策`設為:guilabel:`預付／固定"
"價格`。這代表即使尚未為這些服務記錄任何工時表項目，亦可為此產品產生發票並收取"
"款項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:82
msgid ""
"View of a service product with the invoicing policy set to 'prepaid/fixed'."
msgstr "開立發票政策設為「預付／固定」的服務產品檢視畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:85
msgid ""
"Finally, set the :guilabel:`Sales Price`, and confirm that the unit of "
"measure is set to :guilabel:`Hours`."
msgstr "最後，設定:guilabel:`售價`，並確認計量單位設為:guilabel:`小時`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:89
msgid "Invoice prepaid support services"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:91
msgid ""
"When support services are billed on a fixed price, an invoice can be created"
" before any work is completed on the issue. In this case, a service product "
"with the :guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` set to *Prepaid/Fixed Price* is used, "
"like :ref:`the section above <helpdesk/configure-service-products>`."
msgstr ""
"當支援服務以固定價格計費時，可在完成任何相關問題處理工作前先行建立發票。在此"
"情況下，會使用將 :guilabel:`開立發票政策` 設為 *預付／固定價格* 的服務產品，"
"就如 :ref:`上文部分 <helpdesk/configure-service-products>` 所述。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:96
msgid "Create a sales order with prepaid product"
msgstr "建立包含預付產品的銷售訂單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:98
msgid ""
"To invoice a customer for prepaid support services, first create a sales "
"order (SO) with the support services product. To do this, go to "
":menuselection:`Sales app --> Orders --> Quotations`. Then, click "
":guilabel:`New` to reveal a blank quotation form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:102
msgid "Then, fill out the quotation form with the customer information."
msgstr "然後，在報價單表單中填寫客戶資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:104
msgid ""
"Go to the :guilabel:`Order Lines` tab of the quotation and click "
":guilabel:`Add a product`. Then, select the *prepaid services product* when "
":ref:`configuring the service product <helpdesk/configure-service-"
"products>`. Update the :guilabel:`Quantity` field with the number of hours."
msgstr ""
"前往報價單的 :guilabel:`訂單行` 分頁，並點擊 :guilabel:`新增產品`。然後，在 "
":ref:`配置服務產品 <helpdesk/configure-service-products>` 時選擇 *預付服務產"
"品*。將 :guilabel:`數量` 欄位更新為相應的小時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:109
msgid ""
"After updating any other necessary information, :guilabel:`Confirm` the "
"quotation. This converts the quotation into an |SO|."
msgstr "更新任何其他必要資料後，請 :guilabel:`確認` 報價單。這會將報價單轉換為 |SO|。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:113
msgid "Create and send an invoice for prepaid services"
msgstr "為預付服務建立及發送發票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:115
msgid ""
"After the |SO| has been confirmed, click the :guilabel:`Create Invoice` "
"button. This opens a :guilabel:`Create invoice(s)` pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"確認 |SO| 後，點擊 :guilabel:`建立發票` 按鈕，系統會開啟 :guilabel:`建立發"
"票` 彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:118
msgid ""
"If no down payment is collected, the :guilabel:`Create Invoice` type can "
"remain as :guilabel:`Regular Invoice`. If a :doc:`down payment "
"<../../../sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment>` is collected, choose between "
"either :guilabel:`Down payment (percentage)` or :guilabel:`Down payment "
"(fixed amount)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:123
msgid ""
"When the necessary information has been entered, click :guilabel:`Create "
"Draft`."
msgstr "輸入所需資料後，按一下 :guilabel:`建立草稿`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:125
msgid "The invoice can then be sent to the customer for payment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:128
msgid "Create helpdesk ticket for prepaid services"
msgstr "為預付服務建立服務台工單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:130
msgid ""
"To create a **Helpdesk** ticket for prepaid services, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Helpdesk` and click the :guilabel:`Tickets` button to reveal"
" a specific team's pipeline. Click :guilabel:`New` to create a new ticket."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:134
msgid ""
"On the blank ticket form, create a ticket :guilabel:`Title`, and enter the "
":guilabel:`Customer` information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:137
msgid ""
"When the customer name is added, the :guilabel:`Sales Order Item` field "
"automatically populates with the most recent prepaid sales order item that "
"has time remaining."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:141
msgid "Track hours on helpdesk ticket"
msgstr "追蹤支援中心支援單的時數"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:143
msgid ""
"Time spent working on a **Helpdesk** ticket is tracked on the **Timesheets**"
" tab on the specific ticket."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:146
msgid ""
"On the ticket detail form, click on the :guilabel:`Timesheets` tab and click"
" :guilabel:`Add a line`. Choose an :guilabel:`Employee`, add a "
":guilabel:`Description` of the task, and enter the number of "
":guilabel:`Hours Spent`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:150
msgid ""
"As new lines are added to :guilabel:`Timesheets` tab, the "
":guilabel:`Remaining Hours on SO` field, at the bottom-right of the tab, is "
"automatically updated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:153
msgid ""
"View of the timesheets tab on a ticket with an emphasis on the remaining "
"hours on an SO."
msgstr "支援單上工時表分頁的檢視畫面，重點顯示銷售訂單的剩餘時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:157
msgid ""
"If the number of hours on the :guilabel:`Timesheets` tab exceeds the number "
"of hours sold, the :guilabel:`Remaining Hours of SO` turns red."
msgstr ""
"如果:guilabel:`工時表`分頁上的時數超過已售時數，:guilabel:`銷售訂單剩餘時"
"數`會變成紅色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:160
msgid ""
"An example of a ticket with the number of hours exceeding the hours "
"remaining."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:163
msgid ""
"As hours are added to the :guilabel:`Timesheets` tab, they are automatically"
" updated in the :guilabel:`Delivered` field on the |SO|, as well."
msgstr ""
"將工時新增至:guilabel:`工時表`分頁時，系統亦會自動更新:guilabel:`已交付`欄位"
"（顯示於 |SO| 上）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:167
msgid "Invoice post-paid support services"
msgstr "為後付支援服務開立發票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:169
msgid ""
"When support services are billed based on the amount of time spent on an "
"issue, an invoice cannot be created before the total number of hours "
"required to solve the problem have been entered on a timesheet. In this "
"case, a service product with the :guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` set to "
":guilabel:`Based on Timesheets` is used, like the one that is automatically "
"created after :ref:`the Time Billing <helpdesk/configure-service-products>` "
"feature is enabled."
msgstr ""
"當支援服務按處理問題所花費的時間收費時，必須先在工時表輸入解決問題所需的總時"
"數，才可建立發票。在此情況下，會使用將:guilabel:`開立發票政策`設"
"為:guilabel:`根據工時表`的服務產品，例如在啟用:ref:`時間計費 <helpdesk/"
"configure-service-products>`功能後自動建立的產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:176
msgid "Create a sales order with a time-tracked product"
msgstr "建立包含按時間追蹤產品的銷售訂單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:178
msgid ""
"To invoice a customer for post-paid support services, first create a |SO| "
"with the *Service on Timesheets* product. To do this, go to "
":menuselection:`Sales app --> Orders --> Quotations`. Then, click "
":guilabel:`New` to reveal a blank quotation form."
msgstr ""
"要就後付支援服務向客戶開立發票，請先建立一張包含 *按工時表計算的服務* 產品的 "
"|SO|。為此，請前往 :menuselection:`銷售應用程式 --> 訂單 --> 報價單`。然後，"
"點擊 :guilabel:`新增` 以開啟空白報價單表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:182
msgid "Fill out the quotation with the customer information."
msgstr "在報價單填寫客戶資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:184
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Order Lines` tab, click :guilabel:`Add a product`. Select "
"the :guilabel:`Service on Timesheets` product. After updating any other "
"necessary information, :guilabel:`Confirm` the quotation."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`訂單明細` 分頁上，點擊 :guilabel:`新增產品`。選擇 :guilabel:`工"
"時表服務` 產品。更新任何其他所需資訊後，:guilabel:`確認` 報價單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:189
msgid ""
"Unlike with the prepaid services quotation, Odoo does **not** allow an "
"invoice to be created at this time. Since services were **not** performed, "
"nothing was delivered, so there is nothing to invoice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:194
msgid "Create a helpdesk ticket for time-tracked services"
msgstr "為追蹤工時的服務建立支援服務單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:196
msgid ""
"To record a timesheet entry for time-tracked services, go to the "
":menuselection:`Helpdesk` app, and select the appropriate team for which "
"these services apply."
msgstr ""
"如要為按時追蹤的服務記錄工時表項目，請前往 :menuselection:`服務台` 應用程式，"
"並選擇適用該等服務的團隊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:199
msgid ""
"If there is already an existing ticket for this issue, select it from the "
"Kanban view. This opens the ticket details form. If there is no existing "
"ticket for this customer issue, click :guilabel:`New` to create a new ticket"
" and enter the necessary customer information on the blank ticket details "
"form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:204
msgid ""
"After selecting or creating a ticket, go to the :guilabel:`Sales Order Item`"
" drop-down menu. Select the |SO| created in the previous step."
msgstr ""
"選擇或建立服務單後，前往 :guilabel:`銷售訂單項目` 下拉式選單，並選擇在上一步"
"建立的 |SO|。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:208
msgid "Track support hours on a ticket"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:210
msgid ""
"In order to create an invoice for a product based on timesheets, hours need "
"to be tracked and recorded. At this point, the service is considered "
"*delivered*. To record hours for this support service, click on the "
":guilabel:`Timesheets` tab of the ticket."
msgstr ""
"如要為按工時表計算的產品建立發票，必須先追蹤並記錄工時。此時，該服務會視為 "
"*已交付*。如要為此支援服務記錄工時，請按一下支援單上的 :guilabel:`工時表` 分"
"頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:214
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add a Line` to record a new entry. Select an "
":guilabel:`Employee` from the drop-down menu, and record the time spent in "
"the :guilabel:`Hours Spent` column."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`新增資料行` 以記錄新項目。從下拉式選單選擇 :guilabel:`員工`，"
"並在 :guilabel:`已花費時數` 欄記錄所花時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:217
msgid "Repeat these steps until all timesheet entries have been recorded."
msgstr "重複這些步驟，直至所有工時表項目均已記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:219
msgid "View of the timesheets tab on a helpdesk ticket."
msgstr "支援工單上工時表分頁的檢視畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:223
msgid "Create an invoice for hours tracked on a ticket"
msgstr "為支援單上追蹤的工時建立發票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:225
msgid ""
"If no new timesheets are needed, then create an invoice and send it to the "
"customer."
msgstr "如不需要新增工時表，則建立發票並發送給客戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:227
msgid ""
"To do this, return to the |SO| by clicking on the :guilabel:`Sales Order` "
"smart button at the top of the ticket."
msgstr "要完成此操作並返回 |SO|，請按一下服務單頂部的 :guilabel:`銷售訂單` 智能按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:230
msgid ""
"Before creating the invoice, confirm that the number in the "
":guilabel:`Delivered` column matches the total number of :guilabel:`Hours "
"Spent` listed in the :guilabel:`Timesheets` tab on the ticket."
msgstr ""
"建立發票前，請確認 :guilabel:`已交付` 欄中的數字，與支援單所列的 "
":guilabel:`已用時數`（在 :guilabel:`工時表` 分頁中）總數相符。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:233
msgid "View of a sales order with emphasis on the delivered column."
msgstr "顯示銷售訂單的檢視畫面，並重點標示已送貨欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:236
msgid ""
"Then, click :guilabel:`Create Invoice`. This opens a :guilabel:`Create "
"invoice(s)` pop-up window."
msgstr "然後，按一下 :guilabel:`建立發票`。這會開啟 :guilabel:`建立發票` 彈出式視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:238
msgid ""
"If no down payment is collected, the :guilabel:`Create Invoice` type can "
"remain as :guilabel:`Regular Invoice`. If a down payment is collected, "
"choose between either :guilabel:`Down payment (percentage)` or "
":guilabel:`Down payment (fixed amount)`."
msgstr ""
"如果未收取訂金，:guilabel:`建立發票` 的類型可保持為 :guilabel:`一般發票`。如"
"果已收取訂金，請選擇 :guilabel:`訂金（百分比）` 或 :guilabel:`訂金（固定金額"
"）`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:243
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Timesheets Period` field if this invoice should **only** "
"include timesheets from a certain time period. If this field is left blank, "
"**all** applicable timesheets that have not yet been invoiced are included."
msgstr ""
"請使用 :guilabel:`工時表時段` 欄位，讓這張發票**只**包含特定時段的工時表。如"
"將此欄位留空，系統會包含**所有**尚未開立發票的適用工時表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/track_and_bill.rst:247
msgid ""
"When the necessary information has been entered, click :guilabel:`Create "
"Draft`. The invoice can then be reviewed, edited, and sent to the customer "
"for payment."
msgstr ""
"輸入所需資料後，點擊 :guilabel:`建立草稿`。之後便可檢閱及編輯發票，並發送給客"
"戶付款。"

