msgid ":doc:`reports`"
msgstr ":doc:`reports`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:3
msgid "Receiving tickets"
msgstr "接收支援單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo's **Helpdesk** app offers multiple channels where customers can reach "
"out for assistance, such as email, live chat, and through a website's "
"submission form. The variety of these contact options provides customers "
"with multiple opportunities to receive support quickly while also allowing "
"the support team to manage multi-channel support tickets from one central "
"location."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 的 **服務台** 應用程式提供多種渠道讓客戶尋求協助，例如電郵、即時對話及網"
"站提交表格。多元化的聯絡選項讓客戶有更多途徑快速獲得支援，同時亦讓支援團隊能"
"在單一集中位置管理多渠道支援請求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:11
msgid "Enable channel options to submit tickets"
msgstr "啟用提交支援請求的渠道選項"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:13
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Helpdesk app --> Configuration --> Helpdesk Teams`, "
"and choose an existing team, or click :guilabel:`New` to :doc:`create a new "
"team <../../helpdesk>`."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`支援服務應用程式 --> 配置 --> 支援服務團隊`，選擇現有團"
"隊，或點擊 :guilabel:`新增` 以 :doc:`建立新團隊 <../../helpdesk>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:16
msgid ""
"On the team's settings page, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Channels` and "
":guilabel:`Help Center` sections. Enable one or more channels by checking "
"the respective boxes."
msgstr ""
"在團隊的設定頁面中，向下捲動至 :guilabel:`渠道` 及 :guilabel:`說明中心` 部分"
"。勾選相應的核取方塊以啟用一個或多個渠道。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:19
msgid ":ref:`Email Alias <helpdesk/receiving_tickets/email-alias>`"
msgstr ":ref:`電郵別名 <helpdesk/receiving_tickets/email-alias>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:20
msgid ":ref:`Live Chat <helpdesk/receiving_tickets/live-chat>`"
msgstr ":ref:`線上客服 <helpdesk/receiving_tickets/live-chat>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:21
msgid ":ref:`Website Form <helpdesk/receiving_tickets/website-form>`"
msgstr ":ref:`網站表單 <helpdesk/receiving_tickets/website-form>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:26
msgid "Email Alias"
msgstr "電郵別名"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:28
msgid ""
"The *Email Alias* setting creates tickets from messages sent to that team's "
"specified email alias."
msgstr "*電郵別名* 設定會根據傳送至該團隊指定電郵別名的訊息建立支援請求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:31
msgid ""
"The following steps are for **Odoo Online** and **Odoo.sh** databases. For "
"**On-premise** databases, external servers are required for email aliases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:34
msgid ""
"When a new **Helpdesk** team is created, an email alias is created for it. "
"This alias can be changed on the team's settings page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:37
msgid ""
"To change a **Helpdesk** team's email alias, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Helpdesk app --> Configuration --> Helpdesk Teams`, and "
"click on a team name to open its settings page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:40
msgid ""
"Then, scroll to :menuselection:`Channels --> Email Alias`. In the "
":guilabel:`Alias` field, type the desired name for the team's email alias."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:43
msgid ""
"View of the settings page of a Helpdesk team emphasizing the email alias feature in Odoo\n"
"Helpdesk."
msgstr ""
"Odoo\n"
"服務台中服務台團隊設定頁面的檢視，重點展示電郵別名功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:48
msgid ""
"Custom email domains are **not** required in order to use an email alias, "
"however, they can be configured through the **Settings** app."
msgstr ""
"使用電郵別名 **並非** 必須設定自訂電郵網域，但您仍可透過 **設定** 應用程式進"
"行配置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:51
msgid ""
"If the database does not have a custom domain already configured, click "
":guilabel:`Set an Alias Domain` to be redirected to the :guilabel:`Settings`"
" page. From there, enable :guilabel:`Custom Email Servers`."
msgstr ""
"如果資料庫尚未設定自訂網域，請點擊 :guilabel:`設定別名網域` 以重新導向至 "
":guilabel:`設定` 頁面。然後在該處啟用 :guilabel:`自訂電郵伺服器`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:55
msgid ""
"When an email is received, the subject line becomes the title of a new "
"**Helpdesk** ticket. The body of the email is also added to the ticket, "
"under the :guilabel:`Description` tab, and in the ticket's chatter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:62
msgid "Live Chat"
msgstr "即時對話"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:64
msgid ""
"The **Live Chat** feature lets website visitors connect directly with a "
"support agent or chatbot. **Helpdesk** tickets can be instantly created "
"during these conversations using the :doc:`response command "
"</applications/websites/livechat/responses>` `/ticket`."
msgstr ""
"**線上交談** 功能讓網站訪客可直接聯絡支援人員或聊天機械人。在對話期間，可使"
"用 :doc:`回覆指令 </applications/websites/livechat/responses>` `/ticket` 即時"
"建立 **技術支援** 服務單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:68
msgid ""
"To enable **Live Chat**, navigate to the :menuselection:`Helpdesk app --> "
"Configuration --> Helpdesk Teams` list view, select a team, and on the "
"team's settings page, click the checkbox next to :guilabel:`Live Chat`, "
"under the :guilabel:`Channels` section."
msgstr ""
"若要啟用 **線上即時對談**，請前往 :menuselection:`支援服務應用程式 --> 配"
"置 --> 支援團隊` 清單檢視，選擇一個團隊，然後在該團隊的設定頁面中，點選 "
":guilabel:`線上即時對談` 旁的核取方塊（位於 :guilabel:`頻道` 區塊內）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:73
msgid ""
"If this is the first time :doc:`Live Chat </applications/websites/livechat>`"
" has been enabled on the database, the page may need to be saved manually "
"and refreshed before any further steps can be taken."
msgstr ""
"如果這是首次在資料庫中啟用 :doc:`線上客服 </applications/websites/livechat>"
"`，您可能需要手動儲存並重新整理頁面，然後才可進行後續步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:77
msgid ""
"After the :guilabel:`Live Chat` setting is enabled on a **Helpdesk** team, a"
" new **Live Chat** channel is created. Click on :guilabel:`Configure Live "
"Chat Channel` to update the channel's settings."
msgstr ""
"在 **技術支援** 團隊啟用 :guilabel:`線上交談` 設定後，系統會建立新的 **線上交"
"談** 頻道。點擊 :guilabel:`設定線上交談頻道` 即可更新該頻道的設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:82
msgid "Live Chat channel configuration"
msgstr "線上客服頻道設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:84
msgid ""
"On the channel's settings page, :guilabel:`Channel Name` can be edited, "
"though, Odoo names the channel to match the **Helpdesk** team name, by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"在頻道的設定頁面上，您可以編輯 :guilabel:`頻道名稱`，不過 Odoo 預設會將頻道命"
"名為與 **服務台** 團隊名稱相同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:88
msgid ""
"If a **Helpdesk** team is named `Customer Care`, a **Live Chat** channel is "
"created called `Customer Care`."
msgstr ""
"如果一個 **支援服務** 團隊命名為 `Customer Care`，系統便會建立一個名為 "
"`Customer Care` 的 **即時通訊** 渠道。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:91
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:211
msgid "View of the Kanban cards for the available Live Chat channels."
msgstr "可用即時聊天頻道的看板卡片檢視畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:94
msgid "On the channel form, navigate through the tabs to complete the setup."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:97
msgid "Operators tab"
msgstr "操作員分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:99
msgid ""
"*Operators* are the users who act as agents and respond to live chat "
"requests from customers. The user who created the live chat channel is added"
" by default."
msgstr ""
"*操作員* 是擔任代理並回應客戶即時對話請求的用戶。建立即時對話頻道的用戶會預設"
"加入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:102
msgid ""
"To add additional users, click on the :guilabel:`Operators` tab, then click "
":guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr ""
"如要新增其他使用者，請點擊 :guilabel:`操作員` 分頁，然後點擊 :guilabel:`新"
"增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:104
msgid ""
"Click the checkbox next to the users to be added on the :guilabel:`Add: "
"Operators` pop-up window that appears, then click :guilabel:`Select`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:107
msgid "Click :guilabel:`New` to create new operators, if needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:109
msgid ""
"When the desired addition is complete, click :guilabel:`Save & Close`, or "
":guilabel:`Save & New` to add multiple new operators."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:113
msgid ""
"Creating a new user can impact the status of an Odoo subscription, as the "
"total number of users in a database counts towards the billing rate. Proceed"
" with caution before creating a new user. If a user already exists, adding "
"them as an operator will **not** alter the subscription or billing rate for "
"a database."
msgstr ""
"建立新用戶可能會影響 Odoo 訂閱的狀態，因為資料庫中的用戶總數會計入收費標準。"
"建立新用戶前請謹慎行事。如果用戶已經存在，將其加入為操作員 **不會** 更改資料"
"庫的訂閱或收費標準。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:118
msgid ""
"Additionally, current operators can be edited or removed by clicking on "
"their respective boxes in the :guilabel:`Operators` tab, and then adjusting "
"their form values on the pop-up form that appears, or by using one of the "
"buttons located at the bottom of the form, such as :guilabel:`Remove`."
msgstr ""
"此外，要編輯或移除現有操作員，可在:guilabel:`操作員`分頁中按一下對應的方框，"
"然後在彈出的表單上調整欄位數值，或使用表單底部的其中一個按鈕（例"
"如:guilabel:`移除`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:123
msgid ""
"Users can add themselves as an operator by clicking the :guilabel:`Join "
"Channel` button on a **Live Chat** channel."
msgstr ""
"用戶可在 **線上客服** 頻道點擊 :guilabel:`加入頻道` 按鈕，將自己加入為操作員"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:126
msgid ""
"View of a live chat channel Kanban card with the join button emphasized."
msgstr "即時通訊頻道看板卡片的檢視畫面，其中突顯了加入按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:130
msgid "Options tab"
msgstr "選項分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:132
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Options` tab contains the visual and text settings for the "
"live chat window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:134
msgid "View of the options tab of a Live Chat channel's settings."
msgstr "即時聊天頻道設定中「選項」分頁的檢視畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:137
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Notification Text`: This field updates the greeting displayed in "
"the text bubble when the live chat button appears on the website."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:140
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Livechat Button Color`: This field alters the color of the live "
"chat button as it appears on the website. To change the color, click on a "
"color bubble to open the color selection window, then click and drag the "
"circle along the color gradient. Click out of the selection window once "
"complete. Click the refresh icon to the right of the color bubbles to reset "
"the colors to the default selection."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`即時聊天按鈕顏色`：此欄位用於更改網站上顯示的即時聊天按鈕顏色。要"
"更改顏色，請點擊色塊以開啟顏色選擇視窗，然後在漸層色帶上點擊並拖曳圓點。完成"
"後點擊選擇視窗外部即可。點擊色塊右側的重新整理圖示，即可將顏色重設為預設選項"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:146
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:177
msgid ":guilabel:`Show`: The chat button displays on the selected page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:147
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:179
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Show with notification`: The chat button is displayed, with the "
"addition of the :guilabel:`Notification text` from the :guilabel:`Options` "
"tab."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`連同通知顯示`：系統會顯示聊天按鈕，並額外顯示 :guilabel:`通知文"
"字`（設定於 :guilabel:`選項` 分頁）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:149
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:182
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Open automatically`: The chat button is displayed, and "
"automatically opens the chat window after a designated amount of time. The "
"amount of time is designated in the :guilabel:`Open automatically timer` "
"field, which appears only when this display option is selected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:152
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:186
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Hide`: The chat button is hidden from display on the webpage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:155
msgid ""
"Color selection, for the button or header, can be made manually, or through "
"RGB, HSL, or HEX code selection. Different options are available, depending "
"on the operating system or browser."
msgstr ""
"按鈕或頁首的顏色可手動選擇，或透過 RGB、HSL 或 HEX 代碼選擇。視乎作業系統或瀏"
"覽器而定，可用的選項會有所不同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:159
msgid "Channel Rules tab"
msgstr "頻道規則分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:161
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Channel Rules` tab determines when the live chat window opens"
" on the website by logic of when a :guilabel:`URL Regex` action is triggered"
" (e.g., a page visit)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:165
msgid ""
"A regex, or regular expression, is sometimes referred to as a rational "
"expression. It is a sequence of characters that specifies a match pattern in"
" text. A match is made within the given range of numbers or for the set of "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"正則表達式（regex，即 regular expression）有時亦稱為理性表達式。它是一組字元"
"序列，用於在文字中指定配對模式，並可在指定的數字範圍或字元集內進行配對。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:169
msgid ""
"Edit existing rules by selecting them from the :guilabel:`Channel Rules` "
"tab, or create a new rule by clicking :guilabel:`Add a line`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`頻道規則` 分頁中選擇現有規則進行編輯，或點擊 :guilabel:`新增資"
"料行` 以建立新規則。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:172
msgid ""
"Then, proceed to configure the details for how the rule should apply on the "
"pop-up form that appears."
msgstr "然後，在彈出的表單上設定該規則套用方式的詳細資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:175
msgid "Choose how the *Live Chat Button* displays on the webpage."
msgstr "選擇 *即時聊天按鈕* 在網頁上的顯示方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:188
msgid ""
"To include a :guilabel:`Chatbot` on this channel, select it from the drop-"
"down menu. If the chatbot should only be active when no operators are "
"available, check the box labeled :guilabel:`Enabled only if no operator`."
msgstr ""
"如要在此頻道加入:guilabel:`聊天機械人`，請從下拉選單中選擇。若聊天機械人僅在"
"沒有操作員當值時啟用，請剔選標有:guilabel:`僅在沒有操作員時啟用`的方格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:193
msgid ""
"If a :doc:`chatbot </applications/websites/livechat/chatbots>` is added to a"
" live chat channel, a new :guilabel:`Chatbots` smart button appears on the "
"channel settings form. Click here to create and update the chatbot *script*."
msgstr ""
"如果已將:doc:`聊天機器人 </applications/websites/livechat/chatbots>`加入至線"
"上客服頻道，頻道設定表單上便會出現新的:guilabel:`聊天機器人`智能按鈕。按此即"
"可建立及更新聊天機器人 *腳本*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:197
msgid ""
"Each line in the script contains a :guilabel:`Message`, :guilabel:`Step "
"Type`, :guilabel:`Answers`, and conditional *Only If* logic that applies "
"when certain pre-filled answers are chosen."
msgstr ""
"指令碼中的每一行均包含:guilabel:`訊息`、:guilabel:`步驟類型`、:guilabel:`答"
"案`，以及在選擇特定預設答案時適用的條件式 *僅當（Only If）* 邏輯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:201
msgid ""
"To create more steps in the script, click :guilabel:`Add a line`, and fill "
"out the script steps form, according to the desired logic."
msgstr ""
"如要在腳本中建立更多步驟，請點擊 :guilabel:`新增資料行`，並根據所需邏輯填寫腳"
"本步驟表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:204
msgid ""
"Add the URLs for the pages where the channel should appear in the "
":guilabel:`URL Regex` field. Only the path from the root domain is needed, "
"not the full URL."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`URL 正規表示式` 欄位中，加入頻道應顯示的頁面 URL。只需填寫根網"
"域起計的路徑，無需完整 URL。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:207
msgid ""
"If this channel should only be available to users in specific countries, add"
" those countries to the :guilabel:`Country` field. If this field is left "
"blank, the channel is available to all site visitors."
msgstr ""
"如果此頻道只限特定國家或地區的使用者使用，請將這些國家或地區加入至 "
":guilabel:`國家/地區` 欄位。如果此欄位留空，所有網站訪客均可使用此頻道。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:215
msgid "Widget tab"
msgstr "小工具分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:217
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Widget` tab on the live chat channel form offers a website "
"widget that can be added to third-party websites. Additionally, a URL is "
"available, that can provide instant access to a live chat window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:221
msgid ""
"The live chat :guilabel:`Widget` can be applied to websites created through "
"Odoo by navigating to the :menuselection:`Website app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings --> Email & Marketing`. Then, scroll to the :guilabel:`Live Chat` "
"field, and select the channel to add to the site. Click :guilabel:`Save` to "
"apply."
msgstr ""
"如要將即時聊天 :guilabel:`小工具` 套用至透過 Odoo 建立的網站，請前往 "
":menuselection:`網站應用程式 --> 配置 --> 設定 --> 電郵及市場推廣`，然後捲動"
"至 :guilabel:`即時聊天` 欄位，並選擇要新增至網站的頻道。按 :guilabel:`儲存` "
"以套用變更。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:226
msgid ""
"To add the widget to a website created on a third-party website, click the "
":guilabel:`Copy` button next to the first listed code, and paste the code "
"into the `<head>` tag on the site."
msgstr ""
"要將小工具加至在第三方網站建立的網站，請點擊首段列出程式碼旁邊的 "
":guilabel:`複製` 按鈕，並將程式碼貼上至網站的 `<head>` 標籤內。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:229
msgid ""
"To send a live chat session to a customer or supplier, click the "
":guilabel:`Copy` button next to the second listed code, and send the URL via"
" email."
msgstr ""
"如要將即時聊天對話傳送給客戶或供應商，請點擊第二組代碼旁的 :guilabel:`複製` "
"按鈕，並透過電郵傳送網址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:233
msgid "Create a support ticket from a live chat session"
msgstr "從即時聊天工作階段建立支援工單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:235
msgid ""
"Operators who have joined a live chat channel are able to communicate with "
"site visitors in real-time."
msgstr "已加入即時通訊頻道的客服人員，可與網站訪客進行實時對話。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:238
msgid ""
"During the conversation, an operator can use the shortcut :doc:`command "
"</applications/websites/livechat/responses>` `/ticket` to create a ticket "
"without leaving the chat window. The transcript from the conversation is "
"added to the new ticket, under the :guilabel:`Description` tab."
msgstr ""
"在對話期間，操作員無需離開對話視窗，即可使用 `/ticket` 快捷 :doc:`指令 </"
"applications/websites/livechat/responses>` 建立支援單。對話紀錄會新增至新支援"
"單的 :guilabel:`描述` 分頁中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:244
msgid ""
"**Helpdesk** tickets can also be created through the :doc:`WhatsApp "
"</applications/productivity/whatsapp>` app using the same `/ticket` command."
msgstr ""
"**技術支援** 工單亦可透過 :doc:`WhatsApp </applications/productivity/"
"whatsapp>` 應用程式，使用相同的 `/ticket` 指令來建立。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:250
msgid "Website Form"
msgstr "網站表單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:252
msgid ""
"Enabling the *Website Form* setting adds a new page to the website with a "
"customizable form. A new ticket is created once the required form fields are"
" filled out and submitted."
msgstr ""
"啟用*網站表單*設定後，系統會在網站上新增一個包含可自訂表單的頁面。填妥必填表"
"單欄位並提交後，便會建立新的支援請求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:255
msgid ""
"To activate the website form, navigate to a team's settings page under "
":menuselection:`Helpdesk app --> Configuration --> Helpdesk Teams`, and "
"selecting the desired team from the list."
msgstr ""
"要啟用網站表單，請前往團隊的設定頁面：開啟 :menuselection:`支援中心應用程"
"式 --> 配置 --> 支援團隊`，然後從清單中選擇所需的團隊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:258
msgid ""
"Then, locate the :guilabel:`Website Form` feature, under the :guilabel:`Help"
" Center` section, and check the box."
msgstr ""
"接著，找出 :guilabel:`網站表單` 功能（位於 :guilabel:`支援中心` 部分），並剔"
"選該方格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:261
msgid ""
"If more than one website is active on the database, confirm the correct "
"website is listed in the :guilabel:`Website` field. If not, select the "
"correct one from the drop-down list."
msgstr ""
"如果資料庫中啟用了多個網站，請確認 :guilabel:`網站` 欄位所列的網站正確無誤。"
"如不正確，請從下拉式選單中選取正確的網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:264
msgid ""
"After the feature is activated, click the :guilabel:`Go to Website` smart "
"button at the top of the :guilabel:`Teams` settings page to view and edit "
"the new website form, which is created automatically by Odoo."
msgstr ""
"啟用此功能後，請按一下 :guilabel:`前往網站` 智能按鈕（位於 :guilabel:`團隊` "
"設定頁面頂部），以查看及編輯由 Odoo 自動建立的新網站表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:269
msgid ""
"After enabling the :guilabel:`Website Form` setting, the team's settings "
"page may need to be refreshed before the :guilabel:`Go to Website` smart "
"button appears."
msgstr ""
"啟用 :guilabel:`網站表單` 設定後，可能需要重新整理團隊的設定頁面，系統才會顯"
"示 :guilabel:`前往網站` 智能按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:272
msgid ""
"Additionally, if a *Help Center* is published, the smart button navigates "
"there first. Simply click the :guilabel:`Contact Us` button, at the bottom "
"of the forum, to navigate to the ticket submission form."
msgstr ""
"此外，如已發佈 *支援中心*，該智能按鈕會先導覽至該處。只需按一下討論區底部的 "
":guilabel:`聯絡我們` 按鈕，即可前往工單提交表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:276
msgid ""
"View of the settings page of a helpdesk team emphasizing the Go to Website button in\n"
"Odoo Helpdesk."
msgstr ""
"技術支援團隊設定頁面的檢視，重點顯示 Odoo 技術支援中的\n"
"「前往網站」按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:281
msgid "Website ticket form customization"
msgstr "自訂網站支援單表單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:283
msgid ""
"To customize the default ticket submission form, while on the website, click"
" the :guilabel:`Edit` button in the upper-right corner of the page. This "
"opens the editing sidebar on the right side. Then, click on one of the "
"fields in the form, on the body of the website, to edit it."
msgstr ""
"如要自訂預設的服務單提交表單，請在網站上按一下頁面右上角的:guilabel:`編輯`按"
"鈕，開啟右側的編輯側邊欄。然後，按一下網站主體表單中的其中一個欄位進行編輯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:287
msgid ""
"To add a new field, go to the :guilabel:`Field` section of the sidebar, and "
"click :guilabel:`+ Field`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:290
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`🗑️ (trash can)` icon to delete the field, if necessary."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:292
msgid "Edit the other options for the new field in the sidebar, as desired:"
msgstr "在側邊欄按需要編輯新欄位的其他選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:294
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: matches an Odoo model value to the field (e.g. `Customer "
"Name`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:295
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Input Type`: determine what type of input the field should be, "
"like `Text`, `Email`, `Telephone`, or `URL`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`輸入類型`：決定此欄位的輸入類型，例如 `文字`、`電郵`、`電話` 或 "
"`網址`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:297
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Label`: give the form field a label (e.g. `Full Name`, `Email "
"Address`, etc.). Also control the label position on the form by using the "
"nested :guilabel:`Position` options."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`標籤`：為表單欄位加上標籤（例如 `全名`、`電郵地址` 等）。您亦可使"
"用巢狀的 :guilabel:`位置` 選項，控制標籤在表單上的位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:299
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Description`: determine whether or not to add an editable line "
"under the input box to provide additional contextual information related to "
"the field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`說明`：決定是否在輸入框下方新增可編輯的說明行，以提供與該欄位相關"
"的額外資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:301
msgid ":guilabel:`Placeholder`: add a sample input value."
msgstr ":guilabel:`佔位符`：加入範例輸入值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:302
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default Value`: add common use case values that most customers "
"would find valuable. For example, this can include prompts of information "
"customers should include to make it easier to solve their issue, such as an "
"account number, or product number."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`預設值`：加入大多數客戶認為實用的常見使用情境數值。例如，可加入提"
"示，說明客戶應填寫哪些資料以便解決問題，如帳戶編號或產品編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:305
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Required`: determine whether or not to mark a field as required, "
"in order for the form to be submitted. Toggle the switch from gray to blue."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`必填`：決定是否將欄位設為必填，才可提交表單。將開關由灰色切換至藍"
"色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:307
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Visibility`: allow for absolute or conditional visibility of the "
"field. Nested options, such as, device visibility, appear when certain "
"options are selected."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`可見性`：允許設定欄位的絕對或條件可見性。選取特定選項時，系統會顯"
"示巢狀選項（例如裝置可見性）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:309
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Animation`: choose whether or not the field should include "
"animation."
msgstr ":guilabel:`動畫`：選擇欄位是否應包含動畫效果。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:311
msgid ""
"View of the unpublished website form to submit a ticket for Odoo Helpdesk."
msgstr "用於提交 Odoo 支援服務請求的未發佈網站表單檢視畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:315
msgid ""
"Once the form has been optimized, and is ready for public use, click "
":guilabel:`Save` to apply the changes. Then, publish the form by toggling "
"the :guilabel:`Unpublished` switch to :guilabel:`Published` at the top of "
"the page, if necessary."
msgstr ""
"優化表單並準備好公開使用後，按一下 :guilabel:`儲存` 以套用變更。如有需要，再"
"於頁面頂部將 :guilabel:`未發佈` 開關切換至 :guilabel:`已發佈`，即可發佈表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:320
msgid "Prioritizing tickets"
msgstr "設定支援單優先次序"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:322
msgid ""
"All tickets include a :guilabel:`Priority` field. The highest priority "
"tickets appear at the top of the Kanban and list views."
msgstr ""
"所有服務單均設有 :guilabel:`優先級` 欄位。最高優先級的服務單會顯示在看板及列"
"表檢視的頂部。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:325
msgid ""
"View of a team's Kanban view and the prioritized tasks in Odoo Helpdesk."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:328
msgid "The priority levels are represented by stars:"
msgstr "優先級別以星級表示："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:330
msgid "0 stars = *Low Priority*"
msgstr "0 顆星 = *低優先級*"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:331
msgid "1 star = *Medium Priority*"
msgstr "1 顆星 = *中等優先級*"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:332
msgid "2 stars = *High Priority*"
msgstr "2 顆星 = *高優先級*"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:333
msgid "3 stars = *Urgent*"
msgstr "3 顆星 = *緊急*"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:335
msgid ""
"Tickets are set to low priority (0 stars) by default. To change the priority"
" level, select the appropriate number of stars on the Kanban card, or on the"
" ticket."
msgstr ""
"支援單預設為低優先級（0 粒星）。若要更改優先級別，請在看板卡片或支援單上選擇"
"相應數量的星號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:339
msgid ""
"As priority levels can be used as criteria for assigning :doc:`SLAs <sla>`, "
"changing the priority level of a ticket can alter the :abbr:`SLA (Service "
"Level Agreement)` deadline."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:343
msgid ":doc:`/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:344
msgid ":doc:`../../../general/email_communication`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../general/email_communication`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/receiving_tickets.rst:345
msgid ":doc:`/applications/websites/livechat`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/websites/livechat`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:3
msgid "Reporting"
msgstr "報表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:8
msgid ""
"Reports in Odoo **Helpdesk** provide the opportunity to manage employee "
"workloads, identify areas for improvement, and confirm if customer "
"expectations are being met."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:12
msgid "Available reports"
msgstr "可用報表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:14
msgid ""
"Details about the reports available in Odoo **Helpdesk** can be found below."
" To view the different reports, go to :menuselection:`Helpdesk app --> "
"Reporting`, and select one of the following: :guilabel:`Tickets Analysis`, "
":guilabel:`SLA Status Analysis`, or :guilabel:`Customer Ratings`."
msgstr ""
"以下為 Odoo **支援服務** 提供的報表詳細資訊。如要檢視不同報表，請前往 "
":menuselection:`支援服務應用程式 --> 報表`，並選擇以下其中一項：:guilabel:`工"
"單分析`、:guilabel:`SLA 狀態分析` 或 :guilabel:`客戶評分`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:19
msgid "Tickets Analysis"
msgstr "工單分析"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:21
msgid ""
"The *Tickets Analysis* report (:menuselection:`Helpdesk app --> Reporting "
"--> Tickets Analysis`) provides an overview of every customer support ticket"
" in the database."
msgstr ""
"*支援單分析* 報告（:menuselection:`服務台應用程式 --> 報告 --> 支援單分析`）"
"提供資料庫中每張客戶支援單的概覽。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:24
msgid ""
"This report is useful for identifying where teams are spending the most "
"time, and helps determine if there is an uneven workload distribution among "
"the support staff. The default report counts the number of tickets per team "
"and groups them by stage."
msgstr ""
"此報告有助於識別團隊花費最多時間的範疇，並協助判斷支援人員之間的工作量分配是"
"否不均。預設報告會統計每個團隊的工單數量，並按階段分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:28
msgid "View of Ticket Analysis report default view."
msgstr "支援請求分析報告的預設檢視畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:31
msgid ""
"Alternative measures can be selected to track where the most time is spent "
"at different points in the workflow. To change the measures used for the "
"report that is currently displayed, or to add more, click the "
":guilabel:`Measures` button, and select one or more options from the drop-"
"down menu:"
msgstr ""
"你可選擇其他度量指標，以追蹤工作流程不同環節中耗用最多時間的位置。如要變更目"
"前顯示報告所用的度量指標，或新增更多指標，請點擊 :guilabel:`度量` 按鈕，並從"
"下拉式選單中選擇一個或多個選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:35
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:79
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Average Hours to Respond`: average number of working hours "
"between a message sent from the customer and the response from the support "
"team. *This does not include messages sent when the ticket was in a folded "
"stage.*"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`平均回覆時數`：客戶發出訊息至支援團隊回覆之間的平均工作時數。*此計"
"算不包括支援單處於摺疊階段時所發出的訊息。*"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:38
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Hours Open`: number of hours between the date the ticket was "
"created and the closed date. If there is no closed date on the ticket, the "
"current date is used. **This measure is not specific to working hours.**"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`開啟時數`：建立支援請求的日期與結案日期之間的小時數。如果支援請求"
"沒有結案日期，則使用目前日期。**此指標不限於工作時間。**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:41
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:85
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Hours Spent (Timesheets)`: number of *Timesheet* hours logged on "
"a ticket. *This measure is only available if Timesheets are enabled on a "
"team, and the current user has the access rights to view them.*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:44
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:88
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Hours to First Response`: number of working hours between the "
"date the ticket was received and the date on which the first message was "
"sent. *This does not include email sent automatically when a ticket reaches "
"a stage.*"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`首次回應所需時數`：從收到支援單當日至發送第一則訊息當日之間的工作"
"時數。*這不包括支援單到達特定階段時自動發送的電郵。*"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:47
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Rating (1-5)`: number out of five to represent customer feedback "
"(Dissatisfied = 1, Okay/Neutral = 3, Satisfied = 5)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`評分 (1-5)`：以五分制代表客戶意見回饋（不滿意 = 1，一般／中立 = 3"
"，滿意 = 5）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:49
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Remaining Hours on SO`: hours remaining on a linked sales order."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:50
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:95
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Working Hours to Assign`: number of working hours between the "
"date the ticket was created and when it was assigned to a team member."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`指派所需工作時數`：從建立支援請求的日期到指派給團隊成員之間的工作"
"時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:52
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:97
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Working Hours to Close`: number of working hours between the date"
" the ticket was created and the date it was closed."
msgstr ":guilabel:`關閉所需工作時數`：工單建立日期與關閉日期之間的工作時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:54
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Working Hours until SLA Deadline`: number of working hours "
"remaining to reach the last |SLA| deadline on a ticket."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:56
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:101
msgid ":guilabel:`Count`: number of tickets in total."
msgstr ":guilabel:`計數`：支援單總數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:59
msgid ""
"*Working hours* are calculated based on the default working calendar. To "
"view or change the working calendar, go to the :menuselection:`Settings` "
"application and select :menuselection:`Employees --> Company Working Hours`."
msgstr ""
"*工作時數* 會根據預設工作行事曆計算。如要檢視或變更工作行事曆，請前往 "
":menuselection:`設定` 應用程式，然後選擇 :menuselection:`員工 --> 公司工作時"
"數`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:64
msgid "SLA Status Analysis"
msgstr "SLA 狀態分析"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:66
msgid ""
"The *SLA Status Analysis* report (:menuselection:`Helpdesk app --> Reporting"
" --> SLA Status Analysis`) :ref:`analyzes the performance <helpdesk/analyze-"
"sla-performance>` of individual SLA (Service Level Agreement) policies."
msgstr ""
"*SLA 狀態分析* 報告（:menuselection:`支援中心應用程式 --> 報告 --> SLA 狀態分"
"析`）會針對個別 SLA（服務水平協議）政策 :ref:`進行表現分析 <helpdesk/analyze-"
"sla-performance>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:70
msgid ""
"By default, this report is filtered to show the number of |SLAs| failed, in "
"progress, and the number that have been successful. The results are grouped "
"by teams."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，此報表已篩選為顯示失敗、進行中及已成功的 |SLAs| 數量。結果按團隊"
"分組顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:73
msgid "View of Group by options of Ticket Analysis report."
msgstr "「支援請求分析」報告的「分組依據」選項檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:76
msgid ""
"To change the measures used for the report that is currently displayed, or "
"to add more, click the :guilabel:`Measures` button, and select one or more "
"options from the drop-down menu:"
msgstr ""
"要更改目前顯示報表所使用的計量，或新增更多計量，請按一下 :guilabel:`計量` 按"
"鈕，然後從下拉式選單中選擇一個或多個選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:91
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Number of SLA Failed`: number of tickets that have failed at "
"least one |SLA|."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:92
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Rating (1-5)`: number value representing customer feedback "
"(Dissatisfied = 1, Okay/Neutral = 3, Satisfied = 5)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`評分 (1-5)`：代表客戶意見回饋的數值（不滿意 = 1，普通／中立 = 3，"
"滿意 = 5）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:99
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Working Hours to Reach SLA`: number of working hours between the "
"date the ticket was created and the date the |SLA| was satisfied."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`達成服務水平協議的工作時數`：由建立支援單的日期至符合 |SLA| 的日期"
"之間的工作時數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:104
msgid ":doc:`Service Level Agreements (SLA) <sla>`"
msgstr ":doc:`服務級別協議 (SLA) <sla>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:107
msgid "Customer Ratings"
msgstr "客戶評分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:109
msgid ""
"The *Customer Ratings* report (:menuselection:`Helpdesk app--> Reporting -->"
" Customer Ratings`) displays an overview of the ratings received on "
"individual support tickets, as well as any additional comments submitted "
"with the rating."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:113
msgid "View of the Kanban display in the Customer Ratings report."
msgstr "客戶評分報告中的看板顯示檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:116
msgid ""
"Click on an individual rating to see additional details about the rating "
"submitted by the customer, including a link to the original ticket."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:119
msgid "View of the details of an individual customer rating."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:123
msgid ""
"On the rating's details page, tick the :guilabel:`Visible Internally Only` "
"checkbox to hide the rating from public and portal users."
msgstr ""
"在評分詳情頁面中，勾選 :guilabel:`僅限內部可見` 核取方塊，即可向公眾及入門網"
"站使用者隱藏該評分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:126
msgid ""
"The *Customer Ratings* report is displayed in a Kanban view by default, but "
"can also be displayed in graph, list, or pivot view."
msgstr "*客戶評分* 報表預設以看板檢視顯示，亦可切換為圖表、列表或樞紐分析表檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:130
msgid ":doc:`Ratings <ratings>`"
msgstr ":doc:`評分 <ratings>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:133
msgid "Use cases"
msgstr "使用案例"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:136
msgid "Assessing performance based on customer priority"
msgstr "根據客戶優先順序評估表現"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:138
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Tickets Analysis` report can be used to evaluate the time it "
"takes to address high-priority tickets compared to standard ones. This helps"
" ensure that high-priority tickets are resolved promptly, and identifies any"
" discrepancies in response times based on priority."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:142
msgid ""
"First, navigate to :menuselection:`Helpdesk app --> Reporting --> Tickets "
"Analysis`. Click :guilabel:`Measures`, then select :guilabel:`Working Hours "
"to Close`. Click into the search bar, then under :guilabel:`Group By`, "
"select :guilabel:`Priority`. Finally, under :guilabel:`Filters`, select "
":guilabel:`Closed`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:148
msgid "The pivot view is also useful for this version of the report."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:151
msgid "Monitoring SLA compliance over time"
msgstr "持續監察 SLA 達標情況"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:153
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`SLA Status Analysis` report can be used to track |SLA| "
"compliance trends to identify periods with higher |SLA| breaches. |SLA| "
"breaches happen when support teams fail to meet the response or resolution "
"times promised in |SLAs|, leading to dissatisfied customers, potential "
"financial penalties, and decreased team morale. Identifying these breaches "
"is crucial for tracking real-time performance, uncovering patterns, and "
"addressing root causes—like staffing issues or process inefficiencies."
msgstr ""
"使用 :guilabel:`SLA 狀態分析` 報告，可追蹤 |SLA| 合規趨勢，以識別 |SLA| 違約"
"率較高的時段。|SLA| 違約發生於支援團隊未能達到 |SLAs| 所承諾的回應或解決時間"
"之時，這會導致客戶不滿、潛在財務罰款及團隊士氣下降。識別這些違約情況對於追蹤"
"實時表現、發掘模式及解決根本原因（例如人手不足或流程效率低下）至關重要。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:160
msgid ""
"First, navigate to :menuselection:`Helpdesk app --> Reporting --> SLA Status"
" Analysis`. Click the :icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`(Graph)` icon, then "
"the :icon:`fa-line-chart` :guilabel:`(Line Chart)` icon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:165
msgid ""
"While the :guilabel:`SLA Status Analysis` report defaults to the pivot view,"
" the line chart view provides a better visual representation for this "
"specific use case."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:168
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Measures`, then select :guilabel:`Number of SLAs Failed`. "
"Doing so ensures the data on the report shows **only** information for "
"tickets that failed at least one |SLA|. Click into the search bar, then "
"under :guilabel:`Group By`, select :guilabel:`SLA Deadline`, and select a "
"time frame, either :guilabel:`Month`, :guilabel:`Week`, or :guilabel:`Day`. "
"This option shows when the highest number of tickets with |SLAs| are "
"failing, allowing the team to identify patterns, and prepare for potential "
"issues."
msgstr ""
"按一下 :guilabel:`計量`，然後選擇 :guilabel:`失敗的 SLA 數目`。這樣可確保報表"
"上的資料 **僅** 顯示至少有一項 |SLA| 未能達成的支援單資料。按一下搜尋列，然後"
"在 :guilabel:`分組方式` 下選擇 :guilabel:`SLA 期限`，再選擇一個時間範圍，包"
"括 :guilabel:`月`、:guilabel:`週` 或 :guilabel:`日`。此選項可顯示設有 |SLAs| "
"的支援單在何時出現最多失敗情況，讓團隊識別規律並為潛在問題作好準備。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:176
msgid ""
"The time frame selected for this report may vary depending on a few factors,"
" including the amount of tickets received on a regular basis, the number of "
"|SLAs| enabled in the database, and the workload of the team. It is worth "
"experimenting to see what option delivers the most insights."
msgstr ""
"此報告所選取的時間範圍會視乎多項因素而定，包括日常接收的工單數量、資料庫中已"
"啟用的 |SLAs| 數量，以及團隊的工作量。建議嘗試不同選項，以找出能提供最多分析"
"見解的設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/reports.rst:181
msgid ":doc:`Odoo essentials reporting <../../../essentials/reporting>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Odoo 基礎報告 <../../../essentials/reporting>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:3
msgid "Service level agreements (SLA)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:8
msgid ""
"A *service level agreement* (SLA) defines the level of support a customer "
"can expect from a service provider. |SLAs| provide a timeline that tells "
"customers when they can expect results and keeps the support team on target."
msgstr ""
"*服務水準協議*（SLA）定義客戶可從服務供應商獲得的支援級別。|SLAs| 提供時間表"
"，讓客戶知道預計取得結果的時間，並協助支援團隊按目標推進工作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:13
msgid ""
"The *SLA Policies* feature is enabled by default on newly created "
"**Helpdesk** teams."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:15
msgid ""
"To turn off the feature, or edit the working hours, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Helpdesk app --> Configuration --> Helpdesk Teams`. Click on"
" a team to open that team's configuration page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:18
msgid ""
"From here, scroll to the :guilabel:`Performance` section. To turn off the "
"|SLAs| feature for the team, clear the :guilabel:`SLA Policies` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"由此向下捲動至 :guilabel:`表現` 部分。如要為團隊關閉 |SLAs| 功能，請取消勾選 "
":guilabel:`SLA 政策` 核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:21
msgid "View of a team page in Helpdesk focusing on the SLA Policies setting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:25
msgid "Create a new SLA policy"
msgstr "建立新的 SLA 政策"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:27
msgid ""
"To create a new policy, go to :menuselection:`Helpdesk app --> Configuration"
" --> SLA Policies`, and click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"如要建立新政策，請前往:menuselection:`服務台應用程式 --> 設定 --> SLA 政策`，"
"然後按一下:guilabel:`新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:30
msgid ""
"Alternatively, go to :menuselection:`Helpdesk app --> Configuration --> "
"Helpdesk Teams`, and click on a team. Then, click the :guilabel:`SLA "
"Policies` smart button at the top of the team's settings page, and click "
":guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"或者，前往 :menuselection:`服務台應用程式 --> 配置 --> 服務台團隊`，並按一下"
"某個團隊。接著，按一下團隊設定頁面頂部的 :guilabel:`SLA 政策` 智能按鈕，再按"
"一下 :guilabel:`新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:34
msgid ""
"On the blank |SLA| policy form, enter a :guilabel:`Title` and a "
":guilabel:`Description` for the new policy, and proceed to fill out the form"
" using the steps below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:38
msgid "Define the criteria for an SLA policy"
msgstr "定義 SLA 政策的準則"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:40
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Criteria` section is used to identify which tickets this "
"policy is applied to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:42
msgid "Fill out the following fields to adjust the selection criteria:"
msgstr "填寫以下欄位以調整篩選條件："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:45
msgid ""
"Unless otherwise indicated, multiple selections can be made for each field."
msgstr "除非另有說明，否則每個欄位均可作出多項選擇。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:47
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Helpdesk Team`: A policy can only be applied to one team. *This "
"field is required.*"
msgstr ":guilabel:`支援服務團隊`：每項政策只可套用至一個團隊。*此欄位為必填項。*"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:48
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Priority`: The priority level for a ticket is identified by "
"selecting one, two, or three of the :icon:`fa-star-o` :guilabel:`(star)` "
"icons, representing the priority level on the Kanban card or on the ticket "
"itself. The |SLA| is **only** applied after the priority level has been "
"updated on the ticket to match the |SLA| criteria. If no selection is made "
"in this field, this policy only applies to tickets marked as `Low Priority`,"
" meaning those with zero :icon:`fa-star-o` :guilabel:`(star)` icons."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`優先級`：支援單的優先級別是透過選取一個、兩個或三個 :icon:`fa-"
"star-o` :guilabel:`（星形）` 圖示來識別，代表看板卡片或支援單本身的優先級別"
"。|SLA| **僅** 在支援單的優先級別已更新並符合 |SLA| 條件後才會套用。如果此欄"
"位未作出任何選取，此政策只會套用於標記為 `低優先級` 的支援單，即帶有零個 "
":icon:`fa-star-o` :guilabel:`（星形）` 圖示的支援單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:54
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags`: Tags are used to indicate what the ticket is about. "
"Multiple tags can be applied to a single ticket."
msgstr ":guilabel:`標籤`：標籤用於標示支援請求的主題。單一支援請求可套用多個標籤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:56
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customers`: Individual contacts or companies may be selected in "
"this field."
msgstr ":guilabel:`客戶`：可在此欄位選取個人聯絡人或公司。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:57
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Services`: This field is available only if a team has the "
"**Timesheets** app enabled. This allows the ticket to link directly to a "
"specific line on a sales order, which must be indicated on the ticket in the"
" :guilabel:`Sales Order Items` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`服務`：只有當團隊啟用了 **工時表** 應用程式時，此欄位才會顯示。這"
"可讓支援工單直接連結至銷售訂單上的特定資料行，而該項目必須在支援工單的 "
":guilabel:`銷售訂單項目` 欄位中指明。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:62
msgid ""
"A support team needs to address urgent issues for VIP customers within one "
"business day."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:64
msgid ""
"The new policy, titled `8 Hours to close`, is assigned to the `VIP Support` "
"team. It **only** applies to tickets that are assigned three :icon:`fa-"
"star-o` :guilabel:`(star)` icons, which equates to an `Urgent` priority "
"level."
msgstr ""
"名為 `8 小時內關閉` 的新政策已指派給 `VIP 支援` 團隊。此政策 **只** 適用於獲"
"標記三個 :icon:`fa-star-o` :guilabel:`（星形）` 圖示（即 `緊急` 優先級）的工"
"單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:68
msgid ""
"At the same time, the tickets can be related to multiple issues, so the "
"policy applies to tickets with `Repair`, `Service`, or `Emergency` tags."
msgstr ""
"同時，工單可關聯至多個問題，因此該政策適用於帶有 `維修`、`服務` 或 `緊急` 標"
"籤的工單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:71
msgid ""
"View of a new SLA policy record with all the relevant information entered."
msgstr "已輸入所有相關資訊的新 SLA 政策記錄檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:75
msgid "Establish a target for an SLA policy"
msgstr "為 SLA 政策設定目標"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:77
msgid ""
"A *target* is the stage a ticket needs to reach, and the time allotted to "
"reach that stage, in order to satisfy the |SLA| policy. Any stage assigned "
"to a team may be selected for the :guilabel:`Reach Stage` field."
msgstr ""
"*目標*是指支援請求必須到達的階段，以及為符合 |SLA| 政策而分配給到達該階段的時"
"間。指派給團隊的任何階段都可以在 :guilabel:`到達階段` 欄位中選取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:81
msgid ""
"Time spent in stages selected in the :guilabel:`Excluding Stages` field are "
"**not** included in the calculation of the |SLA| deadline."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`排除階段` 欄位中所選階段花費的時間，**不會** 計入 |SLA| 截止期"
"限的計算中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:85
msgid ""
"An |SLA| titled `8 Hours to Close` tracks the working time before a ticket "
"is completed, and would have `Solved` as the :guilabel:`Reach Stage`. "
"Simultaneously, an |SLA| titled `2 Days to Start` tracks the working time "
"before work on a ticket has begun, and would have `In Progress` as the "
":guilabel:`Reach Stage`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:91
msgid "Meet SLA deadlines"
msgstr "達成 SLA 期限"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:93
msgid ""
"As soon as it is determined that a ticket fits the criteria of an |SLA| "
"policy, a deadline is calculated. The deadline is based on the creation date"
" of the ticket, as well as the targeted working hours."
msgstr ""
"一旦系統判定工單符合 |SLA| 政策的條件，便會計算截止日期。該截止日期根據工單的"
"建立日期以及目標工時計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:98
msgid ""
"The value indicated next to the :guilabel:`Working Hours` field of an |SLA| "
"policy is used to determine the deadline. By default, this is determined by "
"the value set in the :guilabel:`Company Working Hours` field under "
":menuselection:`Settings app --> Employees --> Work Organization`."
msgstr ""
"系統會使用 :guilabel:`工作時數` 欄位（在 |SLA| 政策中）旁顯示的數值來決定截止"
"日期。預設情況下，此數值取決於 :guilabel:`公司工作時數` 欄位（位於 "
":menuselection:`設定應用程式 --> 員工 --> 工作組織`）中所設定的值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:102
msgid ""
"The deadline is then added to the ticket, as well as a tag indicating the "
"name of the |SLAs| applied."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:105
msgid ""
"View of a ticket's form emphasizing an open SLA deadline on a ticket in Odoo"
" Helpdesk."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:108
msgid ""
"When a ticket satisfies an |SLA| policy, the |SLA| tag turns green, and the "
"deadline disappears from view on the ticket."
msgstr "當支援請求符合 |SLA| 政策時，|SLA| 標籤會變成綠色，且請求上不再顯示期限。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:111
msgid "View of a ticket's form emphasizing a satisfied SLA in Odoo Helpdesk."
msgstr "Odoo 支援服務中強調已達成 SLA 的支援單表單檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:115
msgid ""
"If a ticket fits the criteria for more than one |SLA|, the earliest "
"occurring deadline is displayed on the ticket. After that deadline has "
"passed, the next deadline is displayed."
msgstr ""
"如果服務單符合多於一項 |SLA| 的條件，服務單上會顯示最早到期的期限。該期限過後"
"，系統便會顯示下一個期限。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:118
msgid ""
"If the |SLA| deadline passes and the ticket has not moved to the "
":guilabel:`Reach Stage`, the |SLA| tag turns red. After the |SLA| has "
"failed, the red tag stays on the ticket, even after the ticket is moved to "
"the :guilabel:`Reach Stage`."
msgstr ""
"如果超過 |SLA| 期限，而支援請求尚未移至:guilabel:`到達階段`，|SLA| 標籤便會變"
"成紅色。|SLA| 失效後，即使支援請求已移至:guilabel:`到達階段`，紅色標籤仍會保"
"留在支援請求上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:122
msgid ""
"View of a ticket's form with a failing and passing SLA in Odoo Helpdesk."
msgstr "Odoo 服務台中包含未達標及已達標 SLA 的支援單表單檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:128
msgid "Analyze SLA performance"
msgstr "分析 SLA 表現"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:130
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`SLA Status Analysis` report tracks how quickly an |SLA| is "
"fulfilled, as well as the performance of individual team members. Navigate "
"to the report, and corresponding pivot table, by going to "
":menuselection:`Helpdesk app --> Reporting --> SLA Status Analysis`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:135
msgid "Pivot view"
msgstr "樞紐分析檢視"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:137
msgid ""
"By default, the report displays in a :guilabel:`Pivot` view. Any |SLA| "
"policies in the database with tickets that failed to fulfill a policy, are "
"in progress, or have satisfied a policy are listed. By default, they are "
"grouped by team and ticket count."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:141
msgid "View of the SLA status analysis report in Odoo Helpdesk."
msgstr "Odoo 服務台中的 SLA 狀態分析報告檢視畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:144
msgid ""
"The pivot view aggregates data, which can be manipulated by adding measures "
"and filters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:146
msgid ""
"To change the display, or add additional measurements, click the "
":guilabel:`Measures` button to reveal a drop-down menu of reporting "
"criteria, and choose from the options available."
msgstr ""
"要更改顯示內容或加入其他計量項目，請點擊 :guilabel:`計量` 按鈕以展開報告準則"
"的下拉式選單，並從可用選項中選擇。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:149
msgid ""
"Whenever a measurement is picked, a :icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`(check)` "
"icon appears in the drop-down menu to indicate that the measurement is "
"included, and a corresponding new column emerges in the pivot table to show "
"the relevant calculations."
msgstr ""
"每當選取一個度量時，下拉選單中便會出現 :icon:`fa-check` :guilabel:`(剔號)` 圖"
"示，表示該度量已包括在內，而樞紐分析表中亦會新增相應直欄，以顯示相關計算結果"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:153
msgid "View of the available measures in the SLA status analysis report."
msgstr "顯示 SLA 狀態分析報表中可用指標的畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:156
msgid ""
"To add a group to a row or column, click the :icon:`fa-plus-square` "
":guilabel:`(plus)` icon next to the policy name and then select one of the "
"groups. To remove one, click the :icon:`fa-minus-square-o` "
":guilabel:`(minus)` icon next to the policy name."
msgstr ""
"若要在行或欄新增群組，請點擊政策名稱旁邊的 :icon:`fa-plus-square` "
":guilabel:`（加號）` 圖示，然後選取其中一個群組。若要移除群組，請點擊政策名稱"
"旁邊的 :icon:`fa-minus-square-o` :guilabel:`（減號）` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:160
msgid ""
"View of the available group by options in the SLA status analysis report."
msgstr "SLA 狀態分析報表中可用分組依據選項的檢視畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:164
msgid "Graph view"
msgstr "圖表檢視"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:166
msgid ""
"Switch to the graph view by selecting the :icon:`fa-area-chart` "
":guilabel:`(graph view)` icon at the top of the screen. To switch between "
"the different charts, select the *related icon* at the top of the chart, "
"while in graph view."
msgstr ""
"選擇畫面頂部的 :icon:`fa-area-chart` :guilabel:`(圖表檢視)` 圖示，即可切換至"
"圖表檢視。在圖表檢視中，如要切換不同圖表，請選擇圖表頂部的 *相關圖示*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:172
msgid "Bar Chart"
msgstr "棒形圖"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:174
msgid "View of the SLA status analysis report in bar view."
msgstr "以棒形圖檢視的 SLA 狀態分析報表畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:177
msgid ""
"A bar chart can deal with larger data sets and compare data across several "
"categories."
msgstr "棒形圖可處理較大的數據集，並比較多個類別之間的數據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:179
msgid "Line Chart"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:181
msgid "View of the SLA status analysis report in line view."
msgstr "SLA 狀態分析報告的折線圖檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:184
msgid "A line chart can visualize data trends or changes over time."
msgstr "折線圖可將數據隨時間變化的趨勢或轉變視覺化。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:186
msgid "Pie Chart"
msgstr "圓餅圖"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:188
msgid "View of the SLA status analysis report in pie chart view."
msgstr "以圓餅圖檢視顯示的 SLA 狀態分析報告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:191
msgid "A pie chart compares data among a small number of categories."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:194
msgid ""
"Both the *bar chart* and *line chart* can utilize the *stacked* view option."
" This presents two or more groups of data on top of each other, instead of "
"next to each other, making it easier to compare data. While viewing either a"
" bar chart or line chart, click the :icon:`fa-database` "
":guilabel:`(stacked)` icon to toggle the stacked view option on or off."
msgstr ""
" *柱狀圖* 和 *折線圖* 均可使用 *堆疊* 檢視選項。這會將兩組或以上數據上下疊加"
"顯示，而非並排顯示，方便比較數據。檢視柱狀圖或折線圖時，點擊 :icon:`fa-"
"database` :guilabel:`（堆疊）` 圖示，即可開啟或關閉堆疊檢視選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:199
msgid "View of the SLA status analysis report in bar view, stacked."
msgstr "以堆疊條形圖檢視顯示的 SLA 狀態分析報告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:203
msgid "Cohort view"
msgstr "同期群檢視"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:205
msgid ""
"The *cohort* view is used to track the changes in data over a period of "
"time. To display the :guilabel:`SLA Status Analysis` report in a cohort "
"view, click the :icon:`oi-view-cohort` :guilabel:`(cohort)` icon, next to "
"the other view options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:209
msgid "View of the SLA status analysis report in cohort view."
msgstr "SLA 狀態分析報表的同期群檢視畫面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:212
msgid "The cohort view examines the life cycle of data over time."
msgstr "同期群檢視可分析資料隨時間變化的生命週期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:215
msgid ":ref:`Reporting views <reporting/views>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/helpdesk/overview/sla.rst:216
msgid ""
":doc:`Allow customers to close their tickets "
"</applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/close_tickets>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`允許客戶關閉其工單 </applications/services/helpdesk/advanced/"
"close_tickets>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:5
msgid "Planning"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:7
msgid ""
"**Odoo Planning** allows you to plan your team's schedule and manage shifts "
"and resources."
msgstr "**Odoo 規劃** 讓您規劃團隊的時間表，並管理班次及資源。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:9
msgid ""
"Handling your team's planning comes with specific requirements that may vary"
" widely depending on your business needs. The following concepts were "
"introduced in Odoo Planning to meet those needs:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:12
msgid ""
"**Shifts** are dispatched to **resources**, which can be either :ref:`human "
"<planning/employees>` (employees) or :ref:`material <planning/materials>` "
"(e.g., equipment). The resources are assigned :ref:`roles <planning/roles>`,"
" which allows for organization of work within the team."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:16
msgid ""
"Once the initial configuration is done, :ref:`planning shifts "
"<planning/shifts>` can be done manually or automated by using the :ref:`Auto"
" Plan <planning/open-shifts>` feature."
msgstr ""
"完成初始配置後，你可以手動:ref:`安排班次 <planning/shifts>`，或使用:ref:`自動"
"排班 <planning/open-shifts>`功能自動完成。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:19
msgid ""
"An integration between the Planning and Sales apps allows the linking of "
"sold services to roles and shifts in Planning. Additionally, integration "
"with :doc:`Project <project>` allows dedicating shifts, and thus time and "
"resources, to specific projects."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:24
msgid "`Odoo tutorials: Planning <https://www.odoo.com/slides/planning-60>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:34
msgid "Roles"
msgstr "角色"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:36
msgid ""
"To define the roles your resources perform (e.g., chef, bartender, waiter), "
"go to :menuselection:`Planning --> Configuration --> Roles`, then click "
":guilabel:`New`, and fill in the :guilabel:`Name` (e.g., assistant, "
"receptionist, manager). Then, choose the :guilabel:`Resources` that will "
"perform this role. Resources can be either :ref:`Employees "
"<planning/employees>` or :ref:`Materials <planning/materials>`."
msgstr ""
"若要定義資源所擔當的角色（例如：廚師、調酒師、侍應），請前往 "
":menuselection:`規劃 --> 配置 --> 角色`，然後點擊 :guilabel:`新增`，並填寫 "
":guilabel:`名稱`（例如：助理、接待員、經理）。接著選擇將擔當此角色的 "
":guilabel:`資源`。資源可以是 :ref:`員工 <planning/employees>` 或 :ref:`物料 "
"<planning/materials>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:43
msgid ""
"If the Sales app is installed in your database, the :guilabel:`Services` "
"field appears, allowing you to specify which roles are needed to perform "
"services so that the shifts are dispatched to the right person."
msgstr ""
"如果資料庫已安裝銷售應用程式，系統便會顯示:guilabel:`服務`欄位。你可以指定執"
"行服務所需的角色，以便將班次分派予合適人員。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:46
msgid ""
"Roles are taken into account when using the :ref:`Auto Plan feature "
"<planning/open-shifts>`."
msgstr "使用 :ref:`自動規劃功能 <planning/open-shifts>` 時，系統會將角色納入考慮。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:49
msgid "Property fields and roles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:51
msgid ""
"**Property fields** allow you to add custom fields to forms across several "
"Odoo applications. Planning includes the possibility of adding property "
"fields linked to roles to shifts."
msgstr ""
"**屬性欄位**可讓您在多個 Odoo 應用程式的表單中新增自訂欄位。在「規劃」中，您"
"可以將與角色關聯的屬性欄位新增至班次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:54
msgid ""
"To create a property field, switch to the list view from any schedule. From "
"there, click :guilabel:`View` on the shift that you wish to edit. If the "
":guilabel:`Role` field is empty, fill it in with the desired role, then "
"click the cog icon and select :guilabel:`Add Properties`. :doc:`Configure "
"</applications/essentials/property_fields>` the new field according to your "
"needs."
msgstr ""
"要建立屬性欄位，請從任何排程切換至清單檢視。然後，在您要編輯的班次上點擊 "
":guilabel:`檢視`。如果 :guilabel:`角色` 欄位為空，請填入所需的角色，接著點擊"
"齒輪圖示並選擇 :guilabel:`新增屬性`。根據您的需要 :doc:`設定 </applications/"
"essentials/property_fields>` 新欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:59
msgid "Creating a new property field in Planning."
msgstr "在「規劃」中建立新的屬性欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:62
msgid ""
"The property field is linked to the role and is included in the shift form "
"of all shifts performed by this role."
msgstr "此屬性欄位連結至該角色，並包含在該角色執行的所有班次表單中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:66
msgid "Some of the use cases of role property fields include:"
msgstr "角色屬性欄位的部分用途包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:68
msgid ""
"**Accreditation**: for roles that require a specific permit (e.g., driving "
"license)"
msgstr "**認可資格**：適用於需要特定許可證（例如駕駛執照）的職位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:69
msgid ""
"**Location**: in companies that operate in multiple locations (e.g., shops "
"or restaurants)"
msgstr "**地點**：適用於在多個地點營運的公司（例如商店或餐廳）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:70
msgid ""
"**Language**: in a multi-lingual environment (e.g., consulting company)"
msgstr "**語言**：在多語言環境中（例如顧問公司）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:75
msgid "Employees"
msgstr "員工"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:77
msgid "All employees can be included in the planning and assigned shifts."
msgstr "所有員工均可納入排班計劃並獲指派更期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:79
msgid ""
"To adapt the employee's planning settings, go to :menuselection:`Planning "
"--> Configuration --> Employees`, and choose the employee for whom you want "
"to edit the settings. Then, go to the :guilabel:`Work Information` tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:84
msgid ""
"You can do the same from the **Employees** app, which is installed by "
"default along with Planning."
msgstr ""
"你亦可以在 **員工** 應用程式中進行相同操作，該應用程式會隨「規劃」預設一併安"
"裝。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:87
msgid ""
"Two sections of the employee's :guilabel:`Work Information` tab have an "
"impact on Planning: :guilabel:`Schedule` (namely, the :guilabel:`Working "
"Hours` field) and :guilabel:`Planning`."
msgstr ""
"員工的 :guilabel:`工作資料` 分頁中有兩個部分會影響「規劃」模組：:guilabel:`排"
"程`（即 :guilabel:`工作時數` 欄位）及 :guilabel:`規劃`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:93
msgid "Working hours"
msgstr "工作時間"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:95
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Working Hours` are taken into account when the "
":guilabel:`Allocated Time` and its percentage is calculated for :ref:`shifts"
" <planning/templates>`. If the :guilabel:`Working Hours` field is left "
"blank, the employee is considered to be working flexible hours."
msgstr ""
"系統會將 :guilabel:`工作時間` 納入考量，以計算 :guilabel:`已分配時間` 及其在 "
":ref:`班次 <planning/templates>` 中所佔的百分比。如果 :guilabel:`工作時間` 欄"
"位留空，該員工將被視為採用彈性工作時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:99
msgid ""
"To create individual :guilabel:`Working Hours`, for example, for employees "
"working part-time, click :guilabel:`Search more...`, then :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"如要建立個別的 :guilabel:`工作時間`（例如針對兼職員工），請點擊 :guilabel:`搜"
"尋更多...`，然後點擊 :guilabel:`新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:103
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Working Hours` and the :guilabel:`Allocated Time` in Planning"
" can impact **Payroll**, if the employee's contract is configured to "
"generate work entries based on shifts."
msgstr ""
"如果員工合約設定為根據更次產生工作記錄，規劃中的:guilabel:`工作時"
"數`及:guilabel:`分配時間`便會影響 **薪酬** 計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:107
msgid ":doc:`../hr/payroll/working_schedules`"
msgstr ":doc:`../hr/payroll/working_schedules`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:112
msgid "Planning roles"
msgstr "規劃角色"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:114
msgid "Once an employee has one or more :guilabel:`Roles`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:116
msgid ""
"When creating a shift for this employee, only the shift templates from the "
"roles chosen in this field are displayed."
msgstr "為此員工建立班次時，系統只會顯示此欄位中所選職能的班次範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:118
msgid ""
"When a schedule is published, the employee is only notified of open shifts "
"for the roles that are assigned to them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:120
msgid ""
"When auto-assigning open shifts or planning sales orders, the employee is "
"only assigned shifts for the roles assigned to them."
msgstr ""
"自動指派空缺班次或規劃銷售訂單時，系統只會將員工獲指派角色對應的班次指派給該"
"員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:123
msgid "Additionally, when a :guilabel:`Default role` is defined:"
msgstr "此外，當定義了 :guilabel:`預設角色` 時："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:125
msgid ""
"When creating a shift for the employee, the default role is automatically "
"selected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:126
msgid ""
"This role also has precedence over the other roles of the employee when "
"auto-assigning open shifts or planning sales orders."
msgstr "在自動指派空缺班次或規劃銷售訂單時，此角色亦會優先於該員工的其他角色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:130
msgid ""
"If the Planning roles fields are left empty, there are no restrictions in "
"the shift templates and open shifts shared with the employee. However, it's "
"not possible to use the **Auto Plan** feature for employees with no roles."
msgstr ""
"如果規劃角色欄位留空，分享給該員工的班次範本及開放班次將不會受到限制。不過，"
"對於沒有角色的員工，將無法使用 **自動排班** 功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:137
msgid "Materials"
msgstr "物料"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:139
msgid ""
"**Materials** are resources that can be assigned shifts and working hours "
"but are not employees. For example, a construction company could use "
"materials to create shifts for shared machines (e.g., cranes, forklifts)."
msgstr ""
"**物料** 是指非員工但可獲指派班次及工作時數的資源。例如，建築公司可使用物料為"
"共用機械（如起重機、叉車）建立班次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:143
msgid ""
"Similarly to employees, materials can be assigned roles and working time."
msgstr "物料與員工一樣，均可獲指派角色及工作時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:148
msgid "Shift templates"
msgstr "班次範本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:150
msgid ""
"To create a shift template, click :guilabel:`New` on any schedule, then fill"
" in the :ref:`details of the shift <planning/create-shift>`, and click "
":guilabel:`Save Template`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:153
msgid "Shift form."
msgstr "班次表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:156
msgid ""
"Alternatively, go to :menuselection:`Planning --> Configuration --> Shift "
"Templates`, then click :guilabel:`New`. Fill in the :guilabel:`Start & End "
"Hours` and the shift's :guilabel:`Span`, then assign a :guilabel:`Role`."
msgstr ""
"或者，前往 :menuselection:`規劃 --> 配置 --> 班次範本`，然後按一下 "
":guilabel:`新增`。填寫 :guilabel:`開始及結束時間` 以及班次的 :guilabel:`時"
"長`，然後指派一個 :guilabel:`角色`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:160
msgid ""
"If the Project app is installed, a :guilabel:`Project` can also be selected."
msgstr "如果已安裝「專案」應用程式，亦可選擇 :guilabel:`專案`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:165
msgid "Planning shifts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:167
msgid ""
"On opening the Planning app, the users see their own schedule. Users with "
"administrator access rights can also see the schedule :guilabel:`By "
"Resource`, :guilabel:`By Role`, :guilabel:`By Project`, and :guilabel:`By "
"Sales Order`, as well as reporting and configuration menus."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:172
msgid ""
"The schedule is displayed in the Gantt view, which allows you to reassign, "
"reschedule, resize, split, and duplicate shifts without having to open them."
msgstr ""
"時間表會以甘特圖檢視顯示，讓你無須開啟班次，即可重新指派、重新編排時間、調整"
"時長、拆分及複製班次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:175
msgid "A schedule displaying various visual elements."
msgstr "顯示各種視覺元素的時間表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:178
msgid "The following visual elements are used on the shifts in the schedules:"
msgstr "排班表中的班次會使用以下視覺元素："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:180
msgid ""
"**Full color**: shifts that are planned and :ref:`published "
"<planning/shifts-publish>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:181
msgid ""
"**Diagonal stripes**: shifts that are planned but have yet to be "
":ref:`published <planning/shifts-publish>`."
msgstr "**斜線**：已規劃但尚未 :ref:`發佈 <planning/shifts-publish>` 的班次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:183
msgid "**Grayed-out background**: employees who are on time off."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:184
msgid ""
"**Progress bar**: currently ongoing shifts with timesheets linked to them."
msgstr "**進度列**：目前正在進行且已連結工時表的班次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:185
msgid ""
"**Grayed-out shift**: when copying shifts, the copied shifts are shown in "
"full color, whereas previously existing shifts are temporarily greyed out. "
"The color changes back to full color or diagonal stripes on the next refresh"
" of the page or by removing the filter."
msgstr ""
"**反灰顯示的班次**：複製班次時，已複製的班次會以全彩顯示，而先前已存在的班次"
"則會暫時反灰。下次重新整理頁面或移除篩選條件後，顏色會恢復為全彩或斜線條紋。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:192
msgid "Create shifts"
msgstr "建立班次"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:194
msgid ""
"To create a shift, go to any schedule, then click :guilabel:`New`. In the "
"pop-up window that opens, fill in the following details:"
msgstr ""
"如要建立班次，請前往任何排班表，然後點擊 :guilabel:`新增`。在隨即開啟的彈出視"
"窗中，填寫以下詳情："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:197
msgid ""
"**Templates**: If there is one or more :ref:`shift templates "
"<planning/templates>` existing in the database, they are displayed in the "
"upper section of the pop-up window. Once selected, a template prefills the "
"shift form accordingly."
msgstr ""
"**範本**：如果資料庫中有一個或多個 :ref:`班次範本 <planning/templates>`，它們"
"會顯示在彈出視窗的上方區域。選擇範本後，系統會相應預先填寫班次表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:200
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Resources`: Resources can be both employees or materials. If this"
" field is left empty, the shift is considered an :ref:`open shift "
"<planning/open-shifts>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`資源`：資源可以是員工或物料。如留空此欄位，該班次將視為 :ref:`開放"
"班次 <planning/open-shifts>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:202
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date`: Choose the date and time of the shift. This is the only "
"mandatory field when creating a shift."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:204
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Repeat`: Click the :icon:`fa-repeat` :guilabel:`(repeat)` button "
"and configure the :guilabel:`Repeat every` fields as needed. The following "
"rules apply to recurring shifts:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`重複`：按一下 :icon:`fa-repeat` :guilabel:`(重複)` 按鈕，並按需要"
"配置:guilabel:`重複間隔`欄位。以下規則適用於重複班次："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:207
msgid ""
"All fields (e.g., :guilabel:`Resource`, :guilabel:`Role`, "
":guilabel:`Project`) are copied from the original shift except for the date,"
" which is adjusted according to the :guilabel:`Repeat Every` field."
msgstr ""
"所有欄位（例如:guilabel:`資源`、:guilabel:`角色`、:guilabel:`項目`）均會從原"
"有班次複製，只有日期會根據:guilabel:`重複間隔`欄位進行調整。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:210
msgid "Recurrences are planned but not published."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:211
msgid ""
"By default, planned shifts are created six months in advance, after which "
"they are created gradually. To change the time frame, :ref:`activate the "
"developer mode <developer-mode>`, then go to :menuselection:`Planning --> "
"Configuration --> Settings` and edit the :guilabel:`Recurring Shifts`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:216
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Allocated Time`: Is calculated based on the shift's date and "
"time, and the employee's :guilabel:`Working Schedule`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`分配時間`：根據更表的日期及時間，以及員工的 :guilabel:`工作時間"
"表` 計算得出。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:218
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Role`: Select the role that the assigned resources will be "
"performing. This field is especially useful when :ref:`auto-planning "
"<planning/open-shifts>` shifts. Once you select a role, the :ref:`shift "
"templates <planning/templates>` associated with it are displayed in the "
"upper section of the pop-up window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:223
msgid "Additionally, the following fields may also be available:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:225
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Project`: If the :guilabel:`Project planning` setting is enabled "
"in the Planning settings, select the relevant project to link to the shift. "
"Shifts dedicated to the selected project are then planned and tracked "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`項目`：如已在規劃設定中啟用 :guilabel:`項目規劃` 設定，請選擇要連"
"結至此班次的相關項目。專屬於所選項目的班次將相應地進行規劃及追蹤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:228
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Task`: If a project is selected, optionally select a task within "
"that project."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:229
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sales Order`: If the Sales app is installed, select the relevant "
"sales order to link to the shift."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`銷售訂單`：如果已安裝「銷售」應用程式，請選擇要連結至該班次的相關"
"銷售訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:231
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customer`: If the shift is an :doc:`on-site intervention "
"<planning/field_service>`, select the relevant customer to link to the "
"shift."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`客戶`：若該班次為 :doc:`現場服務 <planning/field_service>`，請選擇"
"要連結至該班次的相關客戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:233
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Worksheet`: If :ref:`field service worksheets <planning/field-"
"service/worksheets>` are configured, optionally select the relevant "
"worksheet template."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`工作表`：如已配置 :ref:`現場服務工作表 <planning/field-service/"
"worksheets>`，可選擇性地選取相關的工作表範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:236
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Save` to create the shift, or :guilabel:`Publish` to create"
" it and notify the assigned employee by email."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:242
msgid "Create shifts from sales orders"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:244
msgid ""
"Shifts are created automatically from sales orders containing products "
"configured as follows:"
msgstr "系統會根據包含以下設定產品的銷售訂單，自動建立班次："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:246
msgid ":guilabel:`Product Type`: Set to :guilabel:`Service`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:247
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Plan Services`: Enable the checkbox, then select the relevant "
":ref:`role <planning/roles>`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`計劃服務`：勾選此項，然後選擇相關:ref:`角色 <planning/roles>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:250
msgid ""
"Once the sales order is :ref:`confirmed <sales/create_quotations/send-and-"
"confirm>`, schedule the shift:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:253
msgid "Click the :guilabel:`To Plan` smart button on the sales order form."
msgstr "點擊銷售訂單表單上的 :guilabel:`待規劃` 智能按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:254
msgid "Click the relevant day in the appropriate resource's schedule."
msgstr "按一下相應資源排程中的相關日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:257
msgid ""
"Only :ref:`resources whose role <planning/configuration>` matches the role "
"configured for the product on the sales order are available for shift "
"assignment."
msgstr ""
"只有在:ref:`資源的角色 <planning/configuration>`與銷售訂單上產品所設的角色相"
"符時，該資源才可用於班次指派。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:260
msgid "Select the relevant shift from the list of open shifts for that role."
msgstr "從該角色的空缺班次清單中選擇相關班次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:261
msgid ":ref:`Publish <planning/shifts-publish>` the shift."
msgstr ":ref:`發佈 <planning/shifts-publish>`班次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:264
msgid ""
"To edit the shift before planning it, on the :guilabel:`Schedule by "
"Resource` view:"
msgstr "要在規劃前編輯班次，請在:guilabel:`按資源排班`檢視："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:266
msgid "either click :guilabel:`New`;"
msgstr "或者點按 :guilabel:`新增`；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:267
msgid ""
"or click the relevant day in the appropriate resource's schedule, then click"
" :guilabel:`Create New`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:270
msgid ""
"Then, :ref:`edit the fields <planning/create-shift>` as needed and "
":guilabel:`Save` the shift or :ref:`Publish <planning/shifts-publish>` it."
msgstr ""
"然後，按需要:ref:`編輯欄位 <planning/create-shift>`，並:guilabel:`儲"
"存`或:ref:`發佈 <planning/shifts-publish>`該更表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:273
msgid ""
"Once shifts have been planned for the sales order, click the "
":guilabel:`Planned` smart button on the sales order form to view them."
msgstr ""
"為銷售訂單規劃班次後，點擊銷售訂單表單上的 :guilabel:`已規劃` 智能按鈕即可查"
"看。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:279
msgid "Edit and delete shifts"
msgstr "編輯及刪除班次"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:281
msgid ""
"To edit a shift, click it in the calendar or schedule, then click "
":guilabel:`Edit`."
msgstr "如要編輯班次，請在日曆或時間表上點擊該班次，然後點擊 :guilabel:`編輯`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:283
msgid ""
"Shifts can also be adjusted directly on the schedule, without opening them:"
msgstr "無需開啟更次，亦可直接在時間表上調整："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:285
msgid ""
"Reassign or reschedule a shift by dragging and dropping it to the desired "
"employee and day."
msgstr "將班次拖放至所需的員工及日期，即可重新指派或重新安排班次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:286
msgid ""
"Extend a shift over several days by hovering over the right edge of the "
"shift block. When the cursor changes into a resize pointer, click and drag "
"the edge to the desired day."
msgstr ""
"將游標懸停在班次方塊的右邊緣，即可將班次延長至多天。當游標變為調整大小指標時"
"，點擊並將邊緣拖曳至所需的日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:288
msgid ""
"Split a shift spanning multiple consecutive days into two segments by "
"hovering over the boundary between the two affected day columns, then "
"clicking the :icon:`fa-scissors` (:guilabel:`scissors`) icon."
msgstr ""
"要將跨越多個連續日子的班次分拆為兩段，請將游標停留在兩個受影響日期欄之間的邊"
"界上，然後點擊 :icon:`fa-scissors`（:guilabel:`剪刀`）圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:292
msgid "Split shifts tool."
msgstr "分割輪班工具。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:295
msgid ""
"To delete a shift, click it in the schedule, then click :guilabel:`Delete`."
msgstr "如要刪除班次，請在排程中按一下該班次，然後按 :guilabel:`刪除`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:298
msgid ""
"Alternatively, the shift form can be accessed by switching to the list view "
"and clicking :guilabel:`View` on the relevant shift's line, or by switching "
"to the Kanban view and clicking the relevant shift's card."
msgstr ""
"或者，您亦可切換至清單檢視，然後按一下相關班次資料列上的 :guilabel:`檢視`，或"
"切換至看板檢視並按一下相關班次的卡片，以開啟班次表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:305
msgid "Publish shifts"
msgstr "發佈班次"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:307
msgid ""
"Publishing shifts notifies the assigned employees by email and makes the "
"schedule visible to all users, including those without "
":guilabel:`Administrator` Planning :doc:`access rights "
"</applications/general/users/access_rights>` (via :menuselection:`Planning "
"--> Planning --> All Planning`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:312
msgid "Shifts can be published individually or in bulk."
msgstr "班次可逐一發佈，亦可批次發佈。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:314
msgid "To publish an individual shift:"
msgstr "要發佈個別班次："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:316
msgid ""
"either click :guilabel:`Publish` at the end of the :ref:`shift creation "
"process <planning/create-shift>`;"
msgstr ""
"於最後按一下 :guilabel:`發佈`，完成 :ref:`班次建立程序 <planning/create-"
"shift>`；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:318
msgid ""
"or click the shift in the schedule, click :guilabel:`Edit`, then click "
":guilabel:`Publish` on the shift form."
msgstr ""
"或在排班表中點擊該班次，點擊 :guilabel:`編輯`，然後在班次表單上點擊 "
":guilabel:`發佈`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:321
msgid "To publish all planned shifts:"
msgstr "如要發佈所有已規劃的班次："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:323
msgid "From any schedule, click :guilabel:`Publish`."
msgstr "在任何排程中，按一下 :guilabel:`發佈`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:324
msgid "In the pop-up, optionally edit the :guilabel:`Period`."
msgstr "在彈出視窗中，可按需要編輯 :guilabel:`期間`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:325
msgid ""
"Disable :guilabel:`Include Open Shifts` to exclude :ref:`open shifts "
"<planning/open-shifts>` from the publication."
msgstr ""
"停用 :guilabel:`包括空缺班次`，即可在發佈時排除 :ref:`空缺班次 <planning/"
"open-shifts>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:327
msgid ""
"Optionally edit the list of employees; removing an employee from the list "
"excludes their shifts from this publication."
msgstr "如有需要，可編輯員工列表；從列表中移除員工會將其班次排除於此次發佈之外。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:329
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Publish & Send`."
msgstr "按一下 :guilabel:`發佈並傳送`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:331
msgid "Employees are notified of their shifts once they are published:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:333
msgid ""
"Employees without user accounts are redirected to a dedicated **Planning "
"portal**."
msgstr "沒有用戶帳戶的員工會被重新導向至專用的 **排班門戶網站**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:334
msgid ""
"Employees with a user account are redirected to the :guilabel:`My Planning` "
"view."
msgstr "擁有使用者帳戶的員工會被重新導向至:guilabel:`我的規劃`檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:337
msgid ""
"If the email address of one or more employees in the list has not been "
"configured, enter their :guilabel:`Work Email` in the pop-up that opens, "
"then click :guilabel:`Save & Send Schedule`. If the missing email addresses "
"are not added, the corresponding employees' schedules are not published."
msgstr ""
"如果清單中有一名或多名員工尚未設定電郵地址，請在開啟的彈出視窗中輸入他們"
"的:guilabel:`工作電郵`，然後按一下:guilabel:`儲存並傳送排班`。若未補上遺漏的"
"電郵地址，相應員工的排班將不會發佈。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:341
msgid ""
"Unpublished shifts are only visible on schedules for users with "
":guilabel:`Administrator` Planning :doc:`access rights "
"</applications/general/users/access_rights>` and are identified by diagonal "
"lines."
msgstr ""
"未發佈的班次只會顯示於擁有 :guilabel:`管理員` 規劃 :doc:`存取權限 </"
"applications/general/users/access_rights>` 的使用者的排班表上，並會以斜線標示"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:348
msgid "Open shifts and auto planning"
msgstr "開放班次與自動排班"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:350
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Auto Plan` button allows you to assign **Open shifts** "
"(shifts with no resource assigned) and create and assign shifts linked to "
"sales orders or project tasks."
msgstr ""
"透過 :guilabel:`自動規劃` 按鈕，您可指派 **開放班次**（未指派資源的班次），並"
"建立及指派連結至銷售訂單或專案任務的班次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:353
msgid "The following features have an impact on auto planning:"
msgstr "以下功能會影響自動規劃："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:355
msgid ""
"**Roles**: Open shifts are only assigned to resources (employees or "
"materials) that have the corresponding role assigned. It is not possible to "
"use the :guilabel:`Auto Plan` feature for employees with no role."
msgstr ""
"**角色**：空缺班次只會指派給已獲指派相應角色的資源（員工或物料）。沒有獲指派"
"角色的員工無法使用 :guilabel:`自動規劃` 功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:358
msgid ""
"**Default roles**: The default role assigned to a resource is given priority"
" over the other roles they have assigned to them."
msgstr "**預設角色**：指派給資源的預設角色，會優先於其獲指派的其他角色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:360
msgid ""
"**Conflicts**: Employees or materials cannot be assigned multiple shifts at "
"the same time."
msgstr "**衝突**：員工或物料不可同時獲指派多個班次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:361
msgid ""
"**Time off**: The employees' time off is taken into account, as well as "
"public holidays."
msgstr "**休假**：系統會將員工的休假及公眾假期納入考量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:362
msgid ""
"**Working hours**: Are taken into account when assigning shifts to employees"
" or materials. It is not possible to use the :guilabel:`Auto Plan` feature "
"for an employee who is working :ref:`flexible hours <planning/working-"
"hours>`."
msgstr ""
"**工作時間**：為員工或物料編配班次時會將此納入考慮。:guilabel:`自動排班` 功能"
"不適用於採用 :ref:`彈性工時 <planning/working-hours>` 的員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:365
msgid ""
"**Contracts**: If the employee has an active contract, they won't be "
"assigned shifts that fall outside of their contract period."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:368
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Publish` to confirm the schedule and notify the employees "
"of their planning."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`發佈` 以確認排程，並向員工通知其排班安排。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:373
msgid "Switching shifts and unassignment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:375
msgid ""
"Two features are available to allow employees to make changes to their "
"schedule: **switching shifts** and **unassignment**."
msgstr "系統提供兩項功能，讓員工可以更改其時間表：**調換班次**及**取消指派**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:379
msgid ""
"These features are mutually exclusive. Switching shifts is possible by "
"default and cannot be disabled. However, once the **Allow unassignment** "
"feature is enabled, it replaces the option to switch shifts."
msgstr ""
"這些功能互相排斥。系統預設允許調換班次，且無法停用。然而，一旦啟用**允許取消"
"指派**功能，便會取代調換班次的選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:384
msgid "Switching shifts"
msgstr "交換班次"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:386
msgid ""
"Once shifts are planned and published, employees receive an email "
"notification. If an employee wishes to switch a shift, they can click the "
"unwanted shift and click :guilabel:`Ask to switch`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:389
msgid ""
"The shift remains assigned to the original employee, but in the schedule, a "
"notification informing that the assigned employee would like to switch "
"shifts is visible on the shift."
msgstr ""
"該班次仍會指派予原定員工，但在時間表上，該班次會顯示通知，說明獲指派的員工希"
"望調換班次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:392
msgid ""
"The shift is then displayed to other employees who share the same role, and "
"if they wish to assign it to themselves, they can click the :guilabel:`I "
"take it` button."
msgstr ""
"之後，該班次會顯示給擔任相同職位的其他員工。如果他們想將班次指派給自己，可以"
"點擊 :guilabel:`我接手` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:396
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:414
msgid "The following rules apply:"
msgstr "以下規則適用："

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:398
msgid ""
"Only the shifts matching the employee's roles are displayed as available to "
"them."
msgstr "只有符合員工角色的班次，才會顯示為可供該員工選擇。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:399
msgid "Switching shifts is not available for shifts in the past."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:402
msgid "Unassignment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:404
msgid ""
"To allow employees to unassign themselves from shifts, go to "
":menuselection:`Planning --> Configuration --> Settings`, then tick the "
"checkbox :guilabel:`Allow Unassignment`. Then, specify the maximum number of"
" days that the employees can unassign themselves before the shift."
msgstr ""
"如要允許員工自行取消班次指派，請前往 :menuselection:`規劃 --> 配置 --> 設"
"定`，然後剔選 :guilabel:`允許取消指派` 方格。接著，指定員工在班次開始前可自行"
"取消指派的最大天數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning.rst:409
msgid ""
"Once shifts are planned and published, employees receive an email "
