#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:3
msgid "Field service"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:5
msgid ""
"Field Service allows on-site interventions to be scheduled directly in the "
"Planning app. Work performed can be recorded using custom :ref:`worksheets "
"<planning/field-service/worksheets>`, while :ref:`materials used "
"<planning/field-service/products>` and time spent can be tracked on the "
":ref:`shift <planning/field-service/record>` and billed to the customer. A "
":ref:`customer report <planning/field-service/customer-report>` can be "
"generated at the end of the intervention for signature. :ref:`Itineraries "
"<planning/field-service/itinerary>` can also be planned for field employees."
msgstr ""
"透過現場服務，您可以直接在計劃應用程式中安排現場上門服務。已完成的工作可使用"
"自訂 :ref:`工作表 <planning/field-service/worksheets>` 記錄；:ref:`已使用的物"
"料 <planning/field-service/products>` 及所花時間則可在 :ref:`班次 <planning/"
"field-service/record>` 中追蹤，並向客戶收費。服務結束後可產生 :ref:`客戶報告 "
"<planning/field-service/customer-report>` 供客戶簽署。此外，您亦可為外勤員工"
"規劃 :ref:`行程路線 <planning/field-service/itinerary>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:13
msgid ""
