#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:90
msgid ""
"Once enabled, users are geolocalized upon clicking :guilabel:`Sign In` and "
":guilabel:`Complete` on a shift; the GPS coordinates are logged in the "
"shift's chatter. Click :guilabel:`View on Map` to view the location in "
