"本 <essentials/property-fields/add>`。變更會套用至 **所有** 使用該範本的班次"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/planning/field_service.rst:158
msgid ""
"The worksheet can then be completed in the :guilabel:`Worksheet` tab on the "
"shift form :ref:`during the intervention <planning/field-service/record>`."
