"activitywatch-odoo_patched-latest-setup.exe>`_。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/timesheets/timesheet_assistant.rst:96
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/timesheets/timesheet_assistant.rst:173
msgid "Install the package and follow the instructions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/timesheets/timesheet_assistant.rst:97
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/timesheets/timesheet_assistant.rst:174
msgid ""
"Once the installation is finished, restart your computer or log out and log "
"back in."
msgstr "安裝完成後，請重新啟動電腦，或登出後再重新登入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/timesheets/timesheet_assistant.rst:98
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/timesheets/timesheet_assistant.rst:175
msgid ""
"Access the Odoo database, go to :menuselection:`Timesheets --> Assistant`, "
"and click :guilabel:`Start Now`."
msgstr ""
"進入 Odoo 資料庫，前往 :menuselection:`工時表 --> 助理`，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`立即開始`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/timesheets/timesheet_assistant.rst:100
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/timesheets/timesheet_assistant.rst:177
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Next` twice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/timesheets/timesheet_assistant.rst:101
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/timesheets/timesheet_assistant.rst:178
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Configure CORS` window, copy the Odoo database URL by "
"clicking the :icon:`fa-copy` (:guilabel:`copy`) icon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/timesheets/timesheet_assistant.rst:103
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/timesheets/timesheet_assistant.rst:180
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Open Settings`."
msgstr "按一下 :guilabel:`開啟設定`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/timesheets/timesheet_assistant.rst:104
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/timesheets/timesheet_assistant.rst:181
msgid ""
"On the ActivityWatch web page, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Server "
"Settings` section and paste the Odoo database URL in the :guilabel:`CORS` "
"field."
msgstr ""
"在 ActivityWatch 網頁上，向下捲動至 :guilabel:`伺服器設定` 部分，並在 "
":guilabel:`CORS` 欄位中貼上 Odoo 資料庫網址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/timesheets/timesheet_assistant.rst:106
msgid ""
"Return to the timesheet assistant popup and click :guilabel:`Next` twice."
msgstr "返回工時表助手彈出視窗，並點擊 :guilabel:`下一步` 兩次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/services/timesheets/timesheet_assistant.rst:107
#: ../../export/content/applications/services/timesheets/timesheet_assistant.rst:187
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Test connection` to verify the connection between the Odoo "
"database and the ActivityWatch server."
